hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1801","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ma'iz ko chaar martaba diya"
"1802","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shuf'ah ka faisla kiya; jab tak taqseem na ho, aur us ki hudood muqarrar hon"
"1803","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Nabi nahin magar Us ne bakriyan caraaiin."
"1804","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ne mujhe khabar di ke Unhon ne Jabir ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir Wahy mujh se kuch muddat ruk; main chal raha tha ke ghaare-Hira mein mere paas aane wala farishta aasman-zameen ke darmiyan takht par tha, to main us se daraa. phir main Khadijah ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe chadar orhaao, mujhe chadar orhaao. to mujhe chadar orhaaii gayi phir Jibreel aae aur apne pair se mara: {Aey chadar orhane wale, khade ho aur daro, aur apne Rabb ki takabbur karo, aur apne kapde pak karo, aur buton ko chhodo}. Abu Salamah ne kaha: Ar-rujaza: Woh but hain jin ki woh Allah ke siwa ibadat karte the"
"1805","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se: Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Mu'az Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhte the, phir lautte aur apni qaum ko padhate the"
"1806","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya jabke Aap khutba de rahe the: Jab tum se ek Jume ke din aae jabke imam khutba de raha ho, to do rak'aten padhe"
"1807","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se: Jabir ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mudabbar becha"
"1808","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein azl karte the jabke Aap par Quran nazil hota tha to main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh Jabir se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin"
"1809","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se: Jabir ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jang dhoka hai"
"1810","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jhukte-uthte takbir kehte the"
"1811","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen gadhon ke gosht se mana kiya aur hamen ghode ka gosht khilaya"
"1812","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ise mujh se kaun khareedega hai? To Nu'aim ne aath sau mein khareeda Jabir ne kaha: Qibti ladka jo pichhle saal hua"
"1813","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Maimun al-Makki ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch ooqiya se kam mein zakat nahin"
"1814","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin dinar se kaha: Kya Tum ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko bayan karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kuch log aag se shafa'at se hain? Amr ne kaha: Ji Han"
"1815","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh aag se shafa'at se hain, phir jannat mein dakhil honge"
"1816","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakkaara al-Laisi ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nabeez ke liye dodaa-khajoor aur kishmish-khajoor us se mana kiya"
"1817","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein byaahii aurat se ihsan ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kunwari se kyun nahin, jis se tum khelo aur woh tum khele, jis se tum hanso aur woh tum hanse? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere walid maare gae aur mujh par behnein chhod gae; to Main ne napasand kiya ke ladki se ihsan karun, lekin aisi aurat se ihsan karun jo un ki durust kare farmaya: Allah tumhen barkat de"
"1818","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne napasand kiya ke un ke jaisi naasamajha ladki se ihsan karun, lekin aisi aurat se jo un ki kanghi kare aur un ki durust kare farmaya: Tum ne durust kiya"
"1819","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Muhajireen mein se ek aadmi ne Ansar mein se ek aadmi ko cuutara mara, to Ansari ne kaha: Aey ansaariyo! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jaahilii pukarte kaisi? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Us ne use mara! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhodo; kyunke woh badbudar hai"
"1820","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main beemar tha, aur mere chehre par phoonk lagai, aur main hosh mein aaya; aur farz ki aayat nazil hui {woh tum fatwa mangte hain, kaho Allah tumhen kalaalaa mein fatwa deta hai}."
"1821","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se andar aane ki ijazat mangi, to farmaya: Kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main to farmaya: Main, main — aur Ise napasand kiya"
"1822","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Jab Uhud ke din mere walid jane gae, aur meri phuphi un par rotii hui aaeen, unhon ne kaha: To main rone laga, aur log mujhe mana karne lage, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujhe na mana karte the to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un par roo ya na roo; Allah ki qasam, farishte apne paron se un par saya karte rahe yahan tak ke Tum ne unhen dafanaayaa."
"1823","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Jabir se, ke Abu Bakr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hue jabke Aap wafat pa chuke the, aur Aap peshani cuumii."
"1824","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Hameed ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se mo'min apni izzat bachae, woh us ke liye Sadqa hai"
"1825","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, ke araaba mein se ek aadmi Madinah aaya aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bai'at ki, phir beemar hua to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe chhodo, mujhe chhodo — do ya teen martaba unhon ne kaha: Phir woh nikla, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di gayi ke woh nikal gaya hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Madinah apna mail nikalta hai, aur us ki khoobi nikharatii hai"
"1826","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur ek mahal dekha, woh mujhe achcha wahan to main ne kaha: Yeh mard hai? To kaha gaya: Umar bin al-Khattab ka to Main ne us mein dakhil hona chaha, lekin tumhari ghairat yaad aai to Umar roye aur kaha: Kya Aap par ghairat karunga, Ya Rasulullah?."
"1827","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ya Salim Abu an-Nazr se — ya donon se; Warqa ko shak hua — Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunchi jabke Aap namaz padh rahe the, to main Aap baayen khada hua, aur Aap ne mujhe apne daayen kar diya; aur Main ne Aap ek kapde mein namaz padhte dekha, us ke kinare milae hue"
"1828","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne irada kiya ke pukaarne wale ko hukm dun ke namaz ki pukarte de, phir un aadmiyon par peeche rahun jo namaz se peeche rehte hain, aur un par un ke ghar jala dun"
"1829","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab afzal amal Allah par iman aur Allah ki raah mein jihad hain unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Hajj ki neki Kya hai? Farmaya: Khana khilana aur miithii kalima"
"1830","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur Abu Talha ki biwi ko dekha, aur apne samne aahata suni, to main ne kaha: Yeh Kya hai, Aey Jibreel? Unhon ne kaha: Bilaala."
"1831","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kabhi koi cheez nahin mangi gayi aur Aap ne na kaha"
"1832","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman se, Muhammad bin Amr bin al-Hasan se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the, aur ek aadmi ko dekha jis par chhaon ki gayi thi to poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Rozedar hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safar mein roza neki mein se nahin"
"1833","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Amr bin Hasan ko kehte suna: Jab Hajjaj bin Yusuf aaya to woh namaz der karta tha; to Ham ne Jabir bin Abdullah se namaz ke waqt ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr dopehar ki garmi mein padhte the, ya jab suraj dhal; aur Asr padhte jabke suraj buland hota; aur Maghrib padhte jab suraj duubataa; aur Isha padhte, kabhi der karte aur kabhi jaldi karte; jab log jama hote to jaldi karte, aur jab der karte to der karte; aur Fajr andhere mein padhte the — ya kaha: Woh use andhere mein padhte the Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne aise hi kaha"
"1834","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sulaiman bin Qais se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu taibaa ki taraf bheja aur Unhon ne Aap pachhna kiya aur kaha: Tumhara ka kitna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Teen saaa. to un se ek sa' kam kiya"
"1835","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, muhaariba bin disaara se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) napasand karte the ke aadmi apne gharwalon ke paas raat ko aaye"
"1836","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, muhaariba bin disaara se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se oont becha, to Aap ne taula aur zyada diya to un dirhamon mein se kuch mere paas rahe yahan tak ke hurraa ke din khoye gaye"
"1837","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, muhaariba se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein tha, jabke main oont par tha to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Jabir, Tum ne ihsan ki? Main ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Kunwari ya byaahii? Main ne kaha: Byaahii. farmaya: Tumhen kunwariyon aur un ke khel se Kya?."
"1838","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, muhaariba bin disaara se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein the; jab ham Madinah aae to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Masjid mein aao aur us mein do rak'aten padho"
"1839","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, muhaariba se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Ansar mein se ek aadmi apne do pani dhone wale oonton par Mu'az ke paas pahunchi, jabke woh Maghrib padha rahe the to Mu'az ne Surah-Baqarah ya Nisa se shuru kiya — Shu'bah ne kaha: Muhaariba ko shak hua — to jab us aadmi ne yeh dekha to namaz padhi, phir chala gaya us aadmi ko pahunchi ke Mu'az kehte hain: Woh munafiq hai to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to Rasulullah ne farmaya: Aey Mu'az, Kya fitnebaaza ho, fitnebaaza ho, fitnebaaza ho — ya kaha: Fitna dalne wale — Kya Tum ne nahin padhi: {Apne Rabb ke naam ki paki bayan karo, jo buland hai} ya {raat ki qasam jab ghalib} ya {suraj aur us ki dhoop ki qasam} — Shu'bah ne kaha: Muhaariba ko shak hua — tumhare peeche haajatamanda, chhota padhta hai — ya kaha: Aur kamazora. muhaariba ko shak hua"
"1840","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko suna Shu'bah ne kaha: Aur Husain bin Abdur Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir se kaha: Pera wale din tum kitne the? Unhon ne kaha: Ham pandrah sau the; aur Unhon ne pyas ka zikr kiya jo unhen pahunchee thi unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas taur mein pani laya gaya, aur Aap ne us mein apna hath rakha, aur pani Aap ungliyon ke darmiyan se nikalne laga goya chashme hon unhon ne kaha: To Ham ne piya, aur hamen kafi hua aur poora hua unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Tum kitne the? Unhon ne kaha: Agar ham ek laakha hote to hamen kafi hota; ham pandrah sau the"
"1841","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko suna, Jabir se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek aadmi ke yahan ladka paida hua, aur Unhon ne us ka naam Qasim ka chaha, lekin Ansar ne inkar kiya to is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya gaya, to farmaya: Ansar ne achcha kiya; mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunniyata par kunniyata na rakho"
"1842","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Salim se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunniyata par kunniyata na rakho"
"1843","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Ibn Abi Ziyad se, Salim se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mudd se wuzu karte the, aur sa' se ghusl karte the"
"1844","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek kapde mein namaz padhi"
"1845","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne oont wali raat mein mere liye pachees martaba bakhshish mangi"
"1846","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas izaar na ho woh shalwar pahne, aur jis ke paas joote na ho woh mozaa pahne"
"1847","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath baarish ke din safar mein the, to farmaya: Tum se jo chahe apne dere mein namaz padhe"
"1848","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hajj ka ehram bandhe nikle, to Suraqah bin Malik ne kaha: Hamen apne deen ki khabar den, goya ham us ke liye ab paida hue hain; ham us mein amal karte hain jis mein qalam chal chuki aur taqadiiren guzar chuki, ya nae kinare se? Farmaya: Jis mein qalam chal cukiin. Zuhair ne kaha: Phir Abu az-Zubair ne ek baat kahi jo main na samjha, to Main ne Yasin az-zayyaata se kaha: Unhon ne Kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Amal karo, kyunke har ek ke liye aasan kiya gaya hai"
"1849","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ke sath nakhala mein Zuhr padhi, to mushrikon ne un ka irada kiya, phir kaha: Unhen chhodo; kyunke un ke liye is ke baad ek namaz hai jo unhen apne beton se zyada karti hai to Jibreel Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil hue aur Aap khabar di to Aap ne apne sahaba ke sath Asr padhi, aur unhen do safon mein kiya; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke aage the, aur dushman Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aage tha to sab takbir kahi aur sab ruku kiya, phir jo Aap se mile the Unhon ne sajdah kiya, aur doosre khade rahe jab Unhon ne apne sar uthae to doosron ne sajdah kiya phir yeh aage ho aur woh peeche hate to sab takbir kahi aur sab ruku kiya, phir jo un se mile the Unhon ne sajdah kiya, aur doosre khade rahe jab Unhon ne apne sar uthae to doosron ne sajdah kiya"
"1850","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb Ibn Abi al-Aliya ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe, roghan lage bartan, naqeer aur lakdi se mana kiya"
"1851","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen din baad qurbani ke gosht khane se mana kiya, phir hamen khutba diya aur farmaya: Khao, khilao aur jama karo unhon ne kaha: To Ham ne us mein se qaht gosht banaya, aur use Madinah le gaye"
"1852","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aiman bin naabila ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen tashahhud sikhate the: Allah ke naam se, aur Allah ke sath; tahiyyatu Allah ke liye hain, aur namazen, aur pakeezah baat; salam ho Aap par, Aey Nabi, aur Allah ki rehmat-barkatein; salam ho ham par aur Allah ke nek bandon par; main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande-Rasulullah hain; main Allah se jannat mangta hun, aur us se aag ki panah mangta hun"
"1853","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham Woh-dastuvaaii ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main beemar tha, aur mujh se kaha: Aey Jabir, main tumhen is beemari mein marta dekhta hun; to apni behnon ka hissa wazeh karo to Unhon ne un ke liye do tihai ki wasiyat ki unhon ne kaha: Jabir kehte the: Yeh aayat mujh mein nazil hui: {Agar do aurten hon to un ke liye do tihai hai} aayat"
"1854","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Ansar ki jama'at, apne maal apne paas roko; unhen umrah na do; kyunke jise us ki zindagi mein kuch umrah diya gaya, woh us ki zindagi aur maut ke baad ke liye us ka hai"
"1855","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Bakr bin Abdullah al-Muzani se, us se Jis ne Jabir ko suna Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Abu Ubaidah bin al-Jarrah ke sath bheja, ham teen sau aur kuch das the to hamen khajoor ka thailaa tosha diya, aur us mein se mutthi-mutthi dete the jab woh khatm hua to ek-ek khajoor dete the to ham use cuusate the jaise bachcha cuusataa hai, aur us par pani peete the jab woh raghbat gayi to hamen us ki kam mehsoos hui to ham apni dhanuson se patte jhadte, piisate, aur us par pani peete the, yahan tak ke ham patton ki fauj kahalaae. phir ham samundar ke kinare the, aur ek janwar tha teele jaisa, jise anbara kaha jata hai Abu Ubaidah ne kaha: Murdaara hai, Ise na khao phir kaha: Rasulullah ki fauj aur Allah ki raah mein hain, aur ham majboor hain unhon ne kaha: To Ham ne us mein se bees raaten — ya kaha: Pandrah raaten — khaya, aur us mein se qaht gosht banaya aur mein se barah aadmi us ki aankh ki putalii par baithe aur Abu Ubaidah ne us ki pasaliyon mein se ek pasli li, aur qaum ke oonton mein sab bhaari oont par use laadaa, aur us ke neeche se guzra unhon ne kaha: Jab ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae to farmaya: Tumhen Kis ne roka? Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham Quraish ke Sawaron ke peeche the aur Aap se janwar ka haal bayan kiya, to farmaya: Woh to rizq hai jo Allah ne tumhen di; Kya tumhare paas us mein se kuch hai? To ham ne kaha: Ji Han"
"1856","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne zakhm se Sa'd bin Mu'az ko daaghaa."
"1857","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne zakhm se Sa'd bin Mu'az ko lagaye, aur teer ki nok se us ka khoon roka, to suujana hui, phir doosri martaba khoon roka"
"1858","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram mein pachhna lagwaya, kuulhe mein moca ki wajah se — ya kaha: Peeth mein"
"1859","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke ek aadmi ne apne ghulam ko maut ke baad aazad kiya, to yeh baat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchi to farmaya: Kya tumhare paas is ke siwa kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ise mujh se kaun khareedega hai? To Nu'aim ne aath sau dirham mein khareeda to unhen qeemat di aur kaha: Apne nafs par kharch karo; agar kuch bache to apne qurbadari par; agar kuch bache to yahan, yahan aur yahaan. aur Abu Dawud ne apne hath se apne samne, apne daayen aur apne baayen ishara kiya"
"1860","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fath-Makkah ke din dakhil hue, jabke Aap par kali amame thi"
"1861","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mera naam rakhe woh meri kunniyata na rakhe, aur jo meri kunniyata rakhe woh mera naam na rakhe"
"1862","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne naqeer, roghan lage bartan aur tumbe se mana kiya"
"1863","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye mashkize mein nabeez banai jati thi"
"1864","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shehri dehati ke liye na beche; logon ko chhodo, Allah ek-doosre se rizq de"
"1865","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se kaha: Kya Jabir ne tumhen bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Quhafa se farmaya: Badalo, aur siyahi se bacaao? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin"
"1866","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein sakht garmi ke din suraj ko Kusoof laga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, aur qiyam lamba kiya, yahan tak ke woh girne lage unhon ne kaha: Phir ruku kiya aur lamba kiya, phir uthe aur lamba kiya, phir ruku kiya aur lamba kiya, phir uthe aur lamba kiya, phir do sajde kiye, phir khade hue aur waisa hi kiya to chaar ruku aur chaar sajde hue aur apni namaz mein aage-peeche hone lage phir apne sahaba ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Mujhe jannat-jahannam dikhai gayin; jannat mujh se qareeb hui, yahan tak ke agar main us mein se gucchaa leta to mera hath us se chhota hota — ya kaha: Main use pata; Hisham ko shak hua — aur mujhe aag dikhai gayi, to main dar se peeche hatane laga ke tumhen gher na le aur Main ne ek lambi kali himyarii aurat ko dekha, use us ki billi mein azab diya ja raha tha; Us ne use bandha, na khilaya, na pilaya, aur na chhoda ke zameen ke kiiron mein se khae aur us mein Abu Sumamah Amr bin Malik ko dekha, aag mein apni antariyaan ghasiitataa hua woh kehte the: Suraj-chand ko Kusoof nahin hota magar bade aadmi ke marne par; aur woh Allah Azza-wa Jall ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, woh tumhen dikhaataa hai jab unhen Kusoof lage to namaz padho yahan tak ke khul jae"
"1867","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Dawud ne zikr kiya, Hasan Ibn Abi Ja'far se, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, jitna chaho jiyo, tum marne wale ho; jis se chaho muhabbat karo, tum us se juda hone wale ho; aur jo chaho amal karo, tum us ka samna karne wale ho"
"1868","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tustarii Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi qaum jama na ho phir Allah ke zikr aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par salat ke baghair purani, magar sab sarii murdar se uthen."
"1869","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laisi bakkaara ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu az-Zubair ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nabeez ke liye kishmish-khajoor us se mana kiya, aur dodaa-khajoor us se"
"1870","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakkaara ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu az-Zubair ko suna, Jabir se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar ne — bakkaara ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai Unhon ne Usman ka zikr kiya — gosht khaya, phir namaz padhi aur wuzu na kiya"
"1871","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke talwar ke pakaraaii jae"
"1872","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamzah ke hamanashiin Talib bin Habib bin Amr bin Sahl ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ansari Abdur Rahman bin Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Jabir hurraa ke din nikle, aur un ka pair pathar se zakhmi hua unhon ne kaha: Tabaah ho Jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghabraya main ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Kis ne daraya? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ne Ansar ke is qabeela ko daraya, Us ne woh daraya jo in donon ke darmiyan hai — ya'ni un ke pahaluu."
"1873","[AI-translation] Talib ne kaha: Aur Abdur Rahman bin Jabir ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se aksar jo marte hain, Allah ke hukm, Kitab aur taqdeer ke baad, nazar se marte hain — ya'ni buri nazar se"
"1874","[AI-translation] Talib ne kaha: Aur Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Bani Salamah ne apne gharon se muntaqil hona chaha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke raho; kyunke tum us ke khuunte ho; aur koi banda nahin jo namaz ki taraf ek qadam chale magar us ke liye us se ajr likha jata hai"
"1875","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Amr bin Ata se, Abdul-Malik bin Jabir se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi baat kahe aur murakara dekhe, to woh amanat hai"
"1876","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad Ibn Abi Sulaiman se, Jabir ke gharwalon mein se kisi se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kharabuuzaa taza khajoor se khate the, aur farmate the: Donon pakeezah hain"
"1877","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Matar al-Warraq se, ek aadmi se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main use mu'afi nahin deta jo diyat lene ke baad qatl kare"
"1878","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, haram bin Usman se, Abu Ateeq se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roze mein wisal nahin"
"1879","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yaman Abu Huzaifah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Abs se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Roze mein wisal nahin"
"1880","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qaisii Hajjaj bin Hassan ne ham se bayan kiya, Bani yashkura mein se ek aadmi se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghifar, Allah use muaf kare; aur Aslam, Allah use samet rakhe"
"1881","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yaman Abu Huzaifah aur Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya; Kharijah ne hamen haram bin Usman se, Abu Ateeq se, Jabir se bayan kiya, aur Yaman ne hamen Abu Abs se, Jabir se bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Doodh chhudane ke baad razat nahin, baligh hone ke baad yutma nahin, milkiyat se pahle aazad nahin, nikah se pahle talaq nahin, qata-rehmi mein qasam nahin, hijrat ke baad dehati banna nahin, fath ke baad hijrat nahin, bachche ki qasam walid ke uska nahin, aurat ki qasam shauhar ke uska nahin, ghulam ki qasam sardar ke uska nahin, aur Allah ki nafarmani mein Nazr nahin agar koi dehati das Hajj kare phir hijrat kare, us par ek Hajj hoga agar rasta pae agar koi bachcha das Hajj kare phir baligh ho, us par ek Hajj hoga agar rasta pae agar koi ghulam das Hajj kare phir aazad ho, us par ek Hajj hoga agar rasta pae"
"1882","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aswad bin Qais se, Nabih al-anazii se, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi ghaaiba ho to apne gharwalon ke paas raat ko na aaye"
"1883","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Bani Salamah mein se ek aadmi se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jab Ahzab ke din takleef pahunchee to Aap ne apni chadar utari, nange jism khade hue, hath phailaakara uthae, aur dua ki, namaz na padhi unhon ne kaha: Phir hamare paas aae, aur waisa hi kiya aur namaz padhi"
"1884","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bahili Abu qazaaa ne mujhe bayan kiya, jin ka naam Suwaid bin hai hai, Makki Muhajir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir se kaha: Aadmi jab Ka'ba dekhe to apne hath uthae? Unhon ne kaha: Main kisi ko yeh karte nahin samajhta tha siwae Yahud ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle; Kya ham yeh karte the?."
"1885","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, qaaqaaa bin Hakim se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Maghrib padhte the, phir Bani saliimaa ke paas aate the; agar ham teer nikalte to apne teeron ki girne ki jagah dekhte"
"1886","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Utbah bin Hakim ne ham se bayan kiya, Harmalah se, himsii Abu al-musabbiha se, unhon ne kaha: Ham garmi ki muhim mein chal rahe the, aur logon par khasaamii Malik bin Abdullah the to woh Jabir ke paas aae jabke woh paidal chal rahe the aur apna khaccara hank rahe the to un se kaha: Kya sawar nahin hote jabke Allah ne tumhen sawari di hai? To Jabir ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ke qadam Allah Azza-wa Jall ki raah mein gardaaaluuda hon, Allah use aag par haram karega aur main apne janwar ki durust karta hun, aur apni qaum se ghani rehta hun to log apni Sawariyon se kuude, aur Main ne us din se zyada utarane wale nahin dekhe"
"1887","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi mo'min mard-aurat, Musalman mard-aurat nahin jo beemar jae, magar Allah Azza-wa Jall us se us ki khatayen mitaataa hai"
"1888","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musanna bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sirka Kya hi achcha banane hai"
"1889","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umm-mubashshira ke paas dakhil hue jabke woh apne khajoor ke bagh mein thin to farmaya: Ise Kis ne lagaya, kafir ne ya mo'min ne? To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, lekin mo'min ne to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi mo'min nahin jo paudha lagae ya kheti kare, aur us mein se janwar, darindaa ya parinda khae, magar us ke liye Sadqa hoga"
"1890","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannatiyon jannat mein khaenge-pienge; na thuukenge, na naak saaf karenge, na peshab karenge, na paakhaanaa karenge; mein se ek ki hajat sirf dakaara hai, mushk ki khushbu jaisi khushbu hai"
"1891","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaun-sa Islam behtar hai? Farmaya: Ke Musalman tumhari zuban-hath se mahfooz hon — ya kaha: Woh jis se Musalman us ki zuban-hath se mahfooz rahen unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaun-sa shaheed afzal hai? Farmaya: Ke tumhara ghoda kata jae aur tumhara khoon bahaye jae unhon ne kaha: Kaun-si namaz afzal hai? Farmaya: Lamba qunuuta."
"1892","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, ke Taif walon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamara Shahr thandak Shahr hai; to janabat ke ghusl ke liye hamen Kya kafi hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main to apne sar par teen martaba karta hun"
"1893","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko wafat se teen pahle farmate suna: Tum se koi na mare magar Allah Azza-wa Jall se achcha gumaan rakhte hue"
"1894","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aswad bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Nabih al-anazii ko suna, Jabir se bayan karte hue, ke Uhud ke shaheed jab maare gae to apni sone ki jaghon se uthae gae; phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munadi ne pukara ke shuhada ko un ki sone ki jaghon par wapas aur Abu Dawud ne ek martaba kaha: Un ki girne ki jaghon par unhon ne kaha: Jab Main ne us aadmi ko khajur poori din jo mere walid par thin, to main daurataa aaya goya sharaaraa hun"
"1895","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Mina se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal bechne se mana kiya yahan tak ke tazhu kaha gaya: Pakna Kya hai? Farmaya: Surkh-peela ho"
"1896","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Huzali Sulaim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makki Sa'id bin Mina ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muhaqalah, muzabanah aur mukhabarah se mana kiya"
"1897","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Mina se, Ansari Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najashi par chaar takbiren kahin"
"1898","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Mina se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur tumhari misaal us aadmi jaisi hai Jis ne aag jalaaii, aur tiddiyan-patange us mein girne aayenge, jabke woh unhen us se hataataa hai; aur main tumhen kamarabandon se pakde hun ke aag mein giro, jabke tum mere hath se chuutate ho"
"1899","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Mina se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur ambiya ki misaal us aadmi jaisi hai Jis ne ghar banaya, use kamil-sundara kiya, siwae ek iinta ki jagah ke jo us mein dakhil hota aur use dekhta kehta: Kya hi sundara hai, siwae is iinta ki jagah ke! To main iinta ki jagah hun; mujh par Nabi khatm kiye gaye"
"1900","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sayyar se: Ash-Sha'bi ko suna, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke aadmi apne gharwalon ke paas raat ko aae; yahan tak ke purani balon wali kanghi kare, aur ghaaiba shauhar wali zer-istidad saaf kare"
"1901","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Raziyallahu Asim ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ash-Sha'bi par Jabir bin Abdullah ki taraf se Kitab padhi, jis mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke aurat se us ki phuphi-khala par nikah kiya jae ash-Sha'bi ne kaha: Main ne yeh Jabir se suna"
"1902","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Mughirah se, ash-Sha'bi se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se oont becha, aur Unhon ne Madinah ke safar ke liye mujhe us ki peeth sawar karayi"
"1903","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, faqeer Yazid bin Suhaib se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se safar mein do rak'aton ke bare mein poocha, Kya unhen qasr karun? Jabir ne kaha: Safar mein do rak'aten qasr nahin hain; qasr sirf pada mein ek rak'at hai unhon ne kaha: Phir bayan shuru kiya ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath pada ke waqt the, ke namaz aai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur ek giroh ko apne peeche saf mein kiya, aur ek giroh khadi rahi, un ke chehre dushman ke chehron ki taraf to Aap ne unhen ek rak'at padhai aur unhen do sajde kare phir jo Aap peeche padh chuke the, woh chale aur un ki jagah khade hue to woh aae aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche saf mein hue, aur Aap ne unhen ek rak'at padhai aur unhen do sajde kare phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithe, salam phera, Aap peeche walon ne salam phera, aur Unhon ne salam phera to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye do rak'aten thin, aur qaum ke liye ek-ek rakaata. phir Yazid ne padha: {Aur jab tum mein ho aur un ke liye namaz khadi karo}."
"1904","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dahhak ke bete Abdul-Aziz bin Abdul-Aziz ke bete Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dabbi Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Yahya al-qattaata se, Mujahid se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz ki kunji wuzu hai, aur jannat ki kunji namaz hai"
"1905","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Hamzah bin Suhaib ke bete Abdul-Aziz se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Wahb bin Kaisan ko peshani ke balon par sajdah karte dekha unhon ne kaha: To Main ne un se is ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Jabir ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa karte the"
"1906","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazraa ko kehte suna: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se kaha: bin az-Zubair mut'ah se mana karte hain, jabke Ibn Abbas is ka hukm dete hain Jabir ne kaha: Hadees mere hath par chali; Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein tamattu kiya phir jab Umar aae to khutba diya aur kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye jo chahta tha halal karta tha, aur Quran apni jaghon par nazil ho chuka hai to apne Hajj ko apne umrah se alag karo, aur in aurton se nikah pakka todna; jo aadmi kisi aurat se muddat tak nikah kare, woh mere paas na laya jae magar main use rajm karunga"
"1907","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salt bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazraa ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Talha Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se guzre, to farmaya: Shaheed jo zameen ki peeth par chalta hai"
"1908","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salt bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare amal tumhare qabeela walon-rishtedaron par un ki qabron mein pesh kiye jate hain; agar bhalai ho to woh us se khush hote hain, aur agar us ke siwa ho to kehte hain: Aey Allah, unhen Teri ita'at mein amal ki taufiiqa de"
"1909","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, yashkurii Sulaiman se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah ke din sattar gaayen ya sattar untniyan Qurbani ki; gae saat ki taraf se thi"
"1910","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nasr bin Rashid se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke qabr par gach lagaya jae ya us par banaya jae"
"1911","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Sa'id Ibn Abi kariba se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aediyon ke liye aag se halakat hai"
"1912","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Mashriq ki taraf apni sawari par nafl padhte the; jab farz ka irada karte to utarte aur qible ki taraf munh karte the"
"1913","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Ammar Ibn Abi Ammar se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke paas taza khajur khayein aur pani piya, aur farmaya: Yeh us nemat mein se hai jis ke bare mein tum poocha jayega"
"1914","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin Abdullah bin Suraqah se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jang mein Mashriq ki taraf apni sawari par namaz padhte the"
"1915","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ubaidullah bin Miqsam se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sa' se ghusl karte the to Ibn al-Hanafiyyah ne un se kaha: mere baal ghane hain to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke baal tum ghane aur umdah the"
"1916","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ali bin Husain ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Ubaid bin Umair bayan kar rahe the aur Ibn Umar un ke paas the, to bin Umair ne apni hadees mein kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misaal do baaron ke darmiyan bakri jaisi hai; jab Aap paas aae to Unhon ne use takkara lagai, aur jab un ke paas aae to Unhon ne use takkara mari to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aisa nahin hai; Aap ne sirf kaha: Do revaron ke tak to donon mein ghanamaina-rabazaina mein ikhtilaf hua; Ibn Umar kar aur kaha: Agar Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko na suna hota to na kalima"
"1917","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham se, Naufal se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo namaz chhore goya us ka gharabaara lutaa. Zuhri ne kaha: To Main ne is ka zikr Salim se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Asr ki namaz chhore...."
"1918","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se kisi ke paas se janaza guzre to khada ho yahan tak ke woh use peeche chhod jae"
"1919","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajur beche jin ka ki ho chuka ho, aur wala ne phal ki shart na lagai ho, to us ke liye kuch nahin; aur jo ghulam beche jis ka maal ho aur Us ne us ke maal ki shart na lagai ho, to us ke liye kuch nahin"
"1920","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, muhrim Kya pahne? Farmaya: Qamees na pahne, na amama, na shalwar, na koi kapda jise wars-za'fran laga ho, aur na mouze pahne, siwae is ke ke joote na pae aur unhen takhnon se neeche kaam"
"1921","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phal na khareedo yahan tak ke un ka pakna zahir ho"
"1922","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki Asr ki namaz se goya us ka gharabaara lutaa."
"1923","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghaib ki kunjiyaan di gayin siwae paanch ke; phir yeh aayat padhi: {Beshak Allah ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai} aakhir tak"
"1924","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chand dekhne roza rakho, aur chand dekhne iftar karo; agar tum par badal badal jae to us ka andaza karo"
"1925","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne Ibrahim, Musa aur Isa ko dekha — un par Allah ki salat — baitul-Maqdis mein — ya'ni jahan Aap raat mein le kiya gaya — to Main ne Musa ko dekha, laghar gandumii aadmi, do aadmiyon ke darmiyan, goya shanuuaa ke aadmiyon mein se; aur Main ne Isa ko dekha, surkh aadmi, goya hamaama se nikle hon; aur Ibrahim ke beton mein main un se sab zyada mushaabeha hun aur mere paas sharab ka bartan aur doodh ka bartan laya gaya, to Main ne doodh liya to Jibreel ne kaha: Tum fitrat ki hidayat pae; agar tum sharab lete to tumhari ummat gumrah hoti Zuhri ne kaha: Sa'id hamen yeh bayan karte the, aur Salim ne hamein khabar di thi ke un ke walid ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Isa ke liye surkh nahin kaha; lekin farmaya: Main ne nafs ko khwab mein dekha goya main Baitullah ka tawaf kar raha hun, aur Main ne Isa ko dekha, do aadmiyon ke darmiyan aadmi, goya un ka sar pani tapakaataa ho, ya pani bahaataa ho phir main mutawajjuh aur ek surkh aadmi tha, ghungrale sar wala, dayan aankh se kana, goya us ki aankh tha angoor ho to kaha gaya: Yeh Dajjal hai, logon mein bin qatana al-hain se sab zyada mushaabeha, Bani al-Mustaliq mein se Zuhri ne kaha: Aur woh Jahiliyat mein hua"
"1926","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin Uqbah se, Salim se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Usamah mujhe sab mahboob hain, aur Unhon ne Fatimah ya kisi aur ko alag nahin kiya"
"1927","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min ek bil se do martaba nahin dasa jata Abu Dawud ne kaha: Duniya mein apne gunah ki saza na paega aur aakhirat mein use saza dega"
"1928","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza-wa Jall tumhen apne baapon ki qasam khane se mana karta hai to Umar ne kaha: Jabase Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna, Main ne un ki qasam nahin khayi; jaan ya bhuulakara."
"1929","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mina mein safar ki namaz do rak'aten padhin; phir Abu Bakr ne do rak'aten padhin; phir un ke baad Umar ne do rak'aten padhin; phir un ke baad Usman ne do rak'aten padhin; phir Usman ne baad mein poori kiya"
"1930","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri ya kisi aur se, Salim se — Abu Dawud ko shak hua — Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen namaz halki karne ka hukm dete the, jabke hamen Fajr mein saaffaata se imamat karte the"
"1931","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar ko janaze ke aage chalte dekha"
"1932","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmate suna: Jo Jume ko aae woh ghusl kare"
"1933","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bilal raat ko azan deta hai; to khao-piyo yahan tak ke bin Umm-Maktoom azan de unhon ne kaha: Woh nabina the, aur un se kaha jata tha: Azan do, subah ho gayi hai"
"1934","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se unhon ne kaha: Aur Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari misaal Hum aur bin Sa'd ne kaha: Tum pahle guzar nabiyon mein tumhara baqi rehna sirf Asr ki namaz se suraj doobne tak jaisa hai; Taurat walon ko Taurat di gayi, Unhon ne aadhe din tak amal kiya, aur ek-ek qeerat diye gae; Eisaiyon ko Injeel di gayi, Unhon ne Asr tak amal kiya, aur ek-ek qeerat diye gae; aur hamen Quran diya gaya, Ham ne Asr ki namaz se suraj doobne tak amal kiya, aur do-do qeerat diye gaye to donon Kitab walon ne kaha: Aey hamare Rabb, hamen ek-ek qeerat diya jabke Ham ne un se zyada amal kiya, aur unhen do-do qeerat diye? To farmaya: Kya Main ne tumhare ajr mein se kuch zulm kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin farmaya: Woh mera Fazl hai, jise chaahun dun"
"1935","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin budaila ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Manahuusiyata teen mein hai; ghar, aurat aur ghode mein"
"1936","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Haris se, bin Hamzah bin Umar bin Abdullah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Meri ek biwi thi jis se main muhabbat karta tha, aur mere walid use napasand karte the to Unhon ne mujh se kaha: use talaq do to Main ne inkar kiya to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to farmaya: Use talaq do to Main ne use talaq di"
"1937","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'mar ya Yunus se, az-Zuhri se, Hamzah bin Abdullah se, apne walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall kisi basti ya qaum ko azab na pahunchayega magar sab gheregaa; phir woh qayamat ke din apni niiyaton par uthae jaenge, ya apne a'mal par"
"1938","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, bin Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Umar se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka talbiyah tha: Labbaik Allahumma Labbaik, Labbaik La shareeka laka Labbaik, innal-hamda vanniamataa laka mulk, La shareeka laka. aur Ibn Umar karte the: Labbaik Labbaik, Labbaik wa saadaika, bhalai tumhare hathon mein hai, Labbaik, raghbat-amal Teri taraf hai"
"1939","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne baal jodne wali par lanat ki, aur judwane wali, godne wali aur gudwane wali par"
"1940","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke woh safar mein apni sawari par namaz padhte the jidhar un ki sawari munh karti thi, aur khabar dete the ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa karte the"
