"1942","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne ham par hathyar uthae woh mein se nahin"
"1943","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab masjid banai to aurton ke liye darwaza banaya, aur farmaya: Mardon mein se koi is darwaze se na ghuse. Nafi' ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko na us darwaze se dakhil hote dekha na us se nikalte"
"1944","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah bin Asma ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab teen aadmi hon to do teesre ko chhodkar sargoshi na karen"
"1945","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal bechne se mana kiya yahan tak ke un ka pakna zahir ho; bechne-khareedne wale donon ko is se mana kiya"
"1946","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se jab ek mare to us par us ka guzarne subah-Sham pesh kiya jata hai, jannat mein se aur aag mein se; agar woh jannat mein se ho to jannat mein se, aur agar woh aag walon mein se ho to aag walon mein se"
