"1948","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min ek aanta mein khata hai, aur kafir saat aanton mein khata hai"
"1949","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar mundavaane walon ke liye teen martaba — ya do martaba — bakhshish mangi; to Aap se kaha gaya: Aur baal kataravaane walon ke liye? To farmaya: Aur baal kataravaane walon ke liye"
"1950","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke baad do rak'aten na padhte the, aur na Maghrib ke baad do rak'aten, siwae apne gharwalon mein"
"1951","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram bandha jab Aap sawari Aap sath seedhi hui"
"1952","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka talbiyah tha: Labbaik Allahumma Labbaik, Labbaik La shareeka laka Labbaik, innal-hamda vanniamataa laka mulk, La shareeka laka."
"1953","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, muhrim Kya pahne? Farmaya: Qamees na pahne, na amama, na shalwar, na mouze, siwae is ke ke joote na pae; to mouze pahne, unhen takhnon se neeche kaate; aur koi kapda na pahne jise wars-za'fran laga ho"
"1954","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke woh Masjid-Quba sawar-paidal aate the, aur zikr karte the ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa karte the"
"1955","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ka haq nahin jis ke paas maal ho jis mein wasiyat kare, ke do raat se zyada rahe, magar us ki wasiyat us ke paas likhi ho"
"1956","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, isi tarah"
"1957","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai ko kafir kahe, to mein se ek ke sath lautega; agar woh jis se kaha gaya kafir hai to woh kafir hai, warna kehne wale ki taraf lautegii."
"1958","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sakhr ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masjid ke qible mein thook dekha jabke Aap namaz mein the, to khade-khade use khuracaa. phir jab namaz padh chuke to logon par ghadabnak hue aur farmaya: Tum se jab ek namaz mein ho to Allah Azza-wa Jall us ke chehre ke samne hai; to tum se koi namaz mein apne chehre ke samne na thuuke."
"1959","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Aun ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, to bin Aun se kaha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se? Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar se hone mein to koi shak nahin unhon ne kaha: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein qayamat tak bhalai hui hai"
"1960","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, marfoo'an, isi tarah"
"1961","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Ibn Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aey Abu Abdur Rahman, Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni in aankhon se dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Kya Tum ne un se apni in zubaanon se baat ki? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Kya Tum ne un se apne in daayen hathon se bai'at ki? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Tooba tumhen, Aey Abu Abdur unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhen woh na bataun jo Main ne un se suna? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tooba use Jis ne mujhe dekha aur mujh par iman laya, aur Tooba use Jis ne mujhe na dekha aur mujh par iman laya — teen martaba"
"1962","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Raziyallahu ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne anguthi banai, aur anguthi ka be hatheli ki taraf kiya"
"1963","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik bin Anas, Umari Abdullah Ibn Umar aur Abdullah bin Nafi' — sab — Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dhal mein hath kata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi"
"1964","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek Jume ko aae to ghusl kare"
"1965","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari aur bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fath-Makkah ke din Ka'ba mein dakhil hue, aur apne upar darwaza band kiya; aur Aap sath Fazl bin al-Abbas, Usman bin Talha, Usamah bin Zaid aur Bilal dakhil hue phir jab woh nikle to main logon se daudaya aur un se aage farma, aur Bilal se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kahan namaz padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Donon agle sutoonon ke darmiyan, lakdi ke saamane."
"1966","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur farmaya: Jab tum se ek Jume ko jae to ghusl kare"
"1967","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdi Muhammad bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke sath Ibn Abbas ke paas un ki kisi hajat mein chala; to us din bayan kiya — ya'ni Ibn Umar ne — ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kiya aur Aap ne use jawab na diya to woh chala; jab ghaaiba hone ko hua to deewar ki taraf hath badhaya aur us par hath mara, phir chehra-hath ponchhe, phir doosri martaba dohraya aur kuhaniyon tak ponchhe, phir us aadmi ko jawab diya, phir kaha: Mujhe tumhen jawab dene se sirf Is ne roka ke main pak na tha"
"1968","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin dinar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba se kaha: Sab behtar log kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh aadmi jo apna maal-jaan de to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh achcha aadmi hai, lekin woh nahin; lekin sab afzal aadmi woh hai jo apni taqat de"
"1969","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub aur Ubaidullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di, to Umar ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to farmaya: Woh us se ruju' kare yahan tak ke woh pak ho, phir use haiz aae, phir woh pak ho; kyunke Wahy iddat hai jis ka Allah Azza-wa Jall ne hukm diya hai"
"1970","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghifar, Allah use muaf kare; Aslam, Allah use samet rakhe; aur usayyaa, Jis ne Allah-Rasulullah ki nafarmani ki"
"1971","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quran lekar safar se mana kiya; darte hue ke dushman use pae"
"1972","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Yahudi mard-aurat jane gae jinhon zina kiya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apni Kitab mein Kya pate ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ham rajm nahin pate to bin salam ne kaha: Unhon ne jhoot kaha; rajm un ki Kitab mein hai unhon ne kaha: To bin suuriyaa ko bulaya, aur woh padhne laga, yahan tak ke jab rajm ki jagah pahunchi to rajm ki jagah par hath rakha to bin salam ne kaha: Apna hath chalo to Us ne uthaya, aur rajm ki aayat thi to us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, rajm hamari Kitab mein hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon ko balaata mein rajm kiya unhon ne kaha: Yahudi use apne nafs se mahfooz wahan"
"1973","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein sharab piye, woh aakhirat mein na piye, siwae is ke ke Tauba kare"
"1974","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din do khutbe dete the, mein baithkar farq karte the"
"1975","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par Badr ke din pesh hua, aur main qabool na hua, jabke main terah saal ka tha; aur Aap par Uhud ke din pesh hua jabke main chaudah saal ka tha aur qabool na hua; aur Aap par Khandaq ke din pesh hua jabke main pandrah saal ka tha aur qabool hua"
"1976","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har do khareedne-bechne walon mein koi be' nahin yahan tak ke woh juda hon, siwae is ke ke un ki be' ikhtiyar ki be' ho"
