"1978","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nadabi Bishr bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Main ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiz mein thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Us se ruju' karo yahan tak ke pak ho, phir haiz aae, phir pak ho; agar chaho to talaq do, aur agar chaho to rakho to Ibn Umar ne kaha: To Main ne use talaq di, aur agar main chahta to use karta"
