"1980","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Azdi ya Abdi Abu Amr ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nadabi Abu Amr ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se safar mein namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum mujh se loge agar main tumhen bayan karun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab is Madinah se nikalte, do rak'aten hi padhte rahe yahan tak ke us mein usi aate"
"1981","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Durust Zubair bin al-durust ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se Hajar par bheed ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us ka istilam karte aur bosa dete dekha to main ne kaha: Agar main maghloob hun ya dhakkaa khaauun? Unhon ne kaha: Apna agar-magar us sitare ke sath rakho; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko use bosa dete aur istilam karte dekha"
"1982","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abdullah bin Murrah se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Nazr se mana kiya aur farmaya: Woh koi bhalai nahin aati; us se sirf bakheel se nikali jata hai"
"1983","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, bin Sireen se, Mughirah bin Salman se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Das rak'aten Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yaad ki; Zuhr se pahle do rak'aten, Maghrib ke baad do rak'aten, Isha ke baad do rak'aten, aur Fajr se pahle do rakaaten."
"1984","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak al-Hanafi se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ka'ba mein namaz padhi; aur jald aane wala hai jo tumhen is se mana karega, to us ki na maano; ya'ni bin abbaasa."
"1985","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main Baqi' mein oont bechta tha; deenar mein bechta aur dirham leta, aur dirhamon mein bechta aur dinar leta to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap Hafsah ke ghar dakhil hona chahte the to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Baqi' mein oont bechta hun; deenar mein bechta aur dirham leta, aur dirhamon mein bechta aur dinar leta to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi harj nahin ke unhen din ke rate se lo, jab tak tum juda na ho aur tumhare darmiyan kuch ho"
"1986","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, ke Unhon ne jamaa mein Sa'id bin Jubair ko dekha; to Unhon ne iqamat kahi aur Maghrib teen padhi, phir salam phera, aur Isha do padhi, phir kaha: Ibn Umar ne is jagah hamare sath aisa hi kiya, aur Ibn Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is jagah hamare sath aisa hi kiya"
