"2000","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas izaar na ho woh shalwar pahne; aur jis ke paas joote na ho woh mouze pahne main ne kaha: Muhrim ke liye? Unhon ne kaha: Muhrim ke liye"
"2001","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke woh safar mein apni sawari par namaz padhte the jidhar un ka munh hota tha, aur khabar dete the ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa karte the"
"2002","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala bechne aur use tohfe mein dene se mana kiya main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh nafs un se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan; un ke bete ne un se is ke bare mein poocha tha"
"2003","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajur bechne se mana kiya yahan tak ke un ka pakna zahir ho Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur us ka pakna hai ke us mein se khaya jae"
"2004","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bin dinar se: Ibn Umar ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghallaa bechne se mana kiya yahan tak ke us ka Malik use poora le"
"2005","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin dinar se: Ibn Umar ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Shab-Qadr talash karo; tum se jo use talash kare, use Sattaiswin raat talash kare — ya kaha: Aakhri saat mein"
"2006","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Paanch muhrim hal-haram mein maare; katne wala kutta, chuha, kawwa, bichchu aur ciila."
"2007","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulm qayamat ke din andhere hain"
"2008","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'mash ne mujhe khabar di, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein chand phataa, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gawahi do"
"2009","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Muhajir se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton ko ijazat do ke raat ko masjid mein namaz karte"
"2010","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ahwas Abu Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bees se zyada martaba suna, Maghrib ke baad do rak'aton aur Fajr se pahle do rak'aton mein padhte: {Qul ya ayyuhal-kafirun} aur {Qul huwallahu ahd}."
"2011","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton ko raat ko masajid se na roko to un ke bete ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam, ham unhen rokenge; woh Ise daghala banaatii hain to Unhon ne hath uthaye unhen thappad mara aur kaha: Main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karta hun aur tum yeh kehte ho!."
"2012","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tum Allah ke naam par panah mange use panah do; jo tum Allah ke naam par mange use do; jo tumhen dawat de us ki dawat qabool karo; aur jo tum par ehsan kare us ka badla do; agar woh na pao jis se us ka badla do, to us ki tareef karo yahan tak ke jaan lo ke Tum ne us ka badla diya"
"2013","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor aur A'mash se — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mujhe A'mash ki hadees behtar yaad hai, sanad ek hi hai — donon ne Sa'd bin Ubaidah ko suna, Ibn Umar se bayan karte hue, ke ek aadmi ne un se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha jo Ka'ba ki qasam khae to unhon ne kaha: Ka'ba ki qasam na khao, lekin Ka'ba ke Rabb ki qasam khao; kyunke Umar apne baap ki qasam khate the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Jis ne ghairullah ki qasam khayi Us ne shirk kiya"
"2014","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Malik ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Umar ko jamaa mein dekha; Unhon ne Maghrib-Isha padhin; ek iqamat se donon ko jama kiya, aur kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is jagah aise namaz padhte dekha"
"2015","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhair bin nabina Sabit se, Tameem bin Iyaz se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah Rasulullah bin ulaasaa (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the, to Bilal aae aur Aap namaz ki khabar di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Thehro, Aey Bilal; Alqamah sahar kar len unhon ne kaha: Woh sirii se sahar kar rahe the"
"2016","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Laisi Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Main Aap in do ruknon ke chhoone par bheed karte dekhta hun to unhon ne kaha: Agar main karta hun to liye ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: In donon ka chhoone gunah mitaataa hai"
"2017","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Baitullah ke saat phere kare, ke, har qadam par ek neki likhi jati hai, us se ek burayi mitai jati hai, us ke liye ek darajaa buland kiya jata hai, aur us ke liye gardan aazad karne ke barabar hai"
"2018","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo sharab piye, us ki chalis raat namaz qabool na hogi; agar Tauba kare to Allah us par lautegaa; agar aae to us ki chalis raat namaz qabool na hogi; agar Tauba kare to Allah us par lautegaa; agar aae to us ki chalis raat namaz qabool na hogi; agar Tauba kare to Allah us par lautegaa; agar chauthi martaba aae to us ki chalis raat namaz qabool na hogi; agar Tauba kare to Allah us par na lautegaa; aur Allah par lazim hoga ke use khabaala ki keechad pilaae. kaha gaya: Aey Abu Abdur Rahman, khabaala ki keechad Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Dozakhiyon ka piipa."
"2019","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah ke saat phere kiye, maqam ke peeche do rak'aten padhin, Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i ki, aur farmaya: {Tumhare liye Rasulullah mein umadaa namuna hai}."
"2020","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dastuvaaii Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton ko masajid mein aane se na roko to un ke bete ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, ham unhen rokenge. to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karta hun aur tum yeh kehte ho!."
"2021","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Imran bin Hudair se, Yazid bin Utarid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein khade kar peete the aur chalte-phirate khate the"
"2022","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabalaa bin suhaima ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maheena izafa-izafa-izafa hai; teen martaba apni ungliyon se ishara kiya, aur teesri mein anguuthaa moraa."
"2023","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, jabalaa bin suhaima se, unhon ne kaha: Hamen qahat pahunchi, aur bin az-Zubair ne hamen khajur din; to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Doharii khajoor na khao; kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne doharii se mana kiya, siwae is ke ke tum se ek apne bhai se pooche"
"2024","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, jabalaa bin suhaima se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hantamaa se mana kiya Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Hantamaa Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Matakaa."
"2025","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aaiz bin nusaiba se: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ka'ba mein namaz padhi"
"2026","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, ala bin Musayyab se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us se bayan kiya Jis ne Ibn Umar ko suna — ya kaha: Ibn Umar se poocha — to unhon ne kaha: Aey Abu Abdur Rahman, ham log hain jo apne oont kiraye par dete hain, aur log kehte hain: Tumhara koi Hajj nahin to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha jaisa Tum ne mujh se poocha; to Aap khamosh rahe yahan tak ke yeh aayat nazil hui: {Phir jab tum Arafat se utren to mashaare-haram ke paas Allah ko yaad karo}. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use bulaya aur farmaya: Tum haji ho"
"2027","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Bariqi Hayyan se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar se kaha gaya — ya ek aadmi ne un se kaha: main falan ke peeche namaz padhta hun, aur woh lambi namaz padhta hai? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ki do rak'aten falan ki namaz ki ek rak'at se halki thin, ya falan ki namaz jaisi thin, ya falan ki namaz ki ek rak'at jaisi thin"
"2028","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Uqbah bin main se: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghare, naqeer aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya"
"2029","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Uqbah bin main se: Ibn Umar ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, shab-Qadr ke bare mein: Use aakhri das mein talash karo; agar tum se ek kamzor ho ya aajiz ho, to baqi saat par maghloob na ho"
"2030","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo baghair imam mare, jaahilii maut mara; aur Jis ne ita'at se hath kheencha, qayamat ke din aayega aur us ke paas koi istidlal na hogi"
"2031","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Logon ki misaal sau oonton jaisi hai, mein sawari ke qaabila na mile"
"2032","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Salamah Rahman se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghifar, Allah use muaf kare; Aslam, Allah use samet rakhe; aur usayyaa, Jis ne Allah-Rasulullah ki nafarmani ki"
"2033","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah Rahman se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har nasha sharab hai, aur har nasha haram hai"
"2034","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Zubair se, Ibn Umar aur Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne naqeer, roghan lage bartan aur tumbe se mana kiya"
"2035","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas bin Sireen se — aur Hammad bin Zaid ki hadees zyada kamil hai Hammad bin Zaid ne kaha: Anas bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Mujhe Fajr ki do rak'aton ki khabar den, Kya main mein qira'at lambi karun? To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat mein dogaanaa-dogaanaa padhte the, aur ek se witr padhte the main ne kaha: Main tum yeh nahin poochte raha unhon ne kaha: Tum bhaari bharakama ho; main tumhare liye hadees poori karna chahta hun aur tum mujhe chhodte nahin! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat mein dogaanaa-dogaanaa padhte the, ek se witr padhte the, aur do rak'aten padhte the, goya azan un ke kaanon ke darmiyan ho"
"2036","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jasra ne ham se bayan kiya, Saleet se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bukhar jahannam ki bhaap — ya ki — se hai; to use thande pani se bujhao"
"2037","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Ubaid se, Ziyad bin Jubair se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne ek aadmi ko apni untni Qurbani karte dekha, to kaha: Use khada Qurbani karo; kyunke yeh Abul-Qasim ki sunnat hai"
"2038","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sadqa bin Yasar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah walon ke liye Zul-Zulhulaifah, Sham walon ke liye Juhfah, Najd walon ke liye Qarn, aur Yaman walon ke liye Yalamlam muqarrar kiya"
"2039","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Ubaid se, Ziyad se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha gaya Jis ne Jume ke din roze ki Nazr mani, to unhon ne kaha: Hamen Nazr poori karne ka hukm diya gaya, aur is din roze se mana kiya gaya"
"2040","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ja'far ne mujhe khabar di — jo farmate nahin hain — Abu Musanna se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein azan do-do martaba thi, aur iqamat ek martaba, siwae is ke ke mu'azzin jab kehta: Qad qaamatissalaaha, qad qaamatissalaaha, to do martaba kehta tha"
"2041","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Taweel Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, ammii Zaid se, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek-ek martaba wuzu kiya aur farmaya: Yeh wuzu ka farz hai jis ke baghair namaz jaiz nahin phir do-do martaba wuzu kiya aur farmaya: Yeh us ka wuzu hai jo chahe ke us ka ajr do gunaa kiya jae, do martaba phir teen-teen martaba wuzu kiya aur farmaya: Yeh mera wuzu aur mujh se pahle ambiya ka wuzu hai"
"2042","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Abdullah Ismah alavaana se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna — ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saqeef mein kazzab aur kar hoga"
"2043","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Mijlaz se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se witr ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Raat ke aakhir mein ek rakaata."
"2044","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Raziyallahu se, bin nuema se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas tha, to muhrim ke makkhi marne ke bare mein poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha: Aey Ahle-Iraq, tum mujh se muhrim ke makkhi marne ke bare mein poochte ho, jabke Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti ke bete ko qatl kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya tha: Woh donon duniya mein mere do mahboob phool hain"
"2045","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Maqburi Sa'id se, Ubaid bin Juraij se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Aey Abu Abdur Rahman, main Aap aisi cheezen karte dekhta hun jo Main ne kisi ko karte nahin dekha unhon ne kaha: Batao, tum to munkar baat bhejte ho unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap apni dadhi piilii karte dekha unhon ne kaha: Aur Kya? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap Baitullah mein se sirf do rukn chhute dekha; siyahi aur Yamani; aur Main ne Aap dekha ke ehram nahin lagate yahan tak ke Aap sawari Aap sath seedhi ho to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Range ka jo Tum ne zikr kiya, Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni dadhi par kuch zard lagate dekha aur do ruknon ka, Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tawaf kiya aur Aap un ke siwa chhute nahin dekha aur ehram ka, Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, Aap ehram nahin lagate the yahan tak ke Aap sawari Aap sath seedhi hoti thi"
"2046","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, hannaata Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Iraq walon mein se ek aadmi ko suna, Ibn Umar se poocha; to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fajr ke baad namaz se mana kiya yahan tak ke suraj nikle aur din chadhe, aur Asr ke baad namaz se mana kiya yahan tak ke suraj duube."
"2047","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, hannaata Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawaron ko ja na milo; Shehri dehati ki taraf se na beche; aur aadmi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na de yahan tak ke woh nikah kare ya chhod"
"2048","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Zubair se, Ali bin Bariqi Abdullah se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab safar ka irada karte aur apni sawari par sawar hote to teen martaba takbir kehte, phir kehte: {Pak hai woh Jis ne hamare liye is ko yahi mein kiya} donon aayaten. Aey Allah, main tujh se apne is safar mein neki-taqwa mangta hun, aur amal mein se jo Tu pasand kare aur razi ho Aey Allah, hamare liye zameen ki doori lapet de, aur ham par safar aasan karo Aey Allah, hamare safar mein hamara sathi ban, aur hamare gharwalon mein hamara khalifa bana. aur jab lautte to kehte: Laut wale, Tauba karne wale, apne Rabb ki tareef karne len"
"2049","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Abdullah ko suna, Ibn Umar se bayan karte hue — Shu'bah samajhte hain Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — ke farmaya: Raat-din ki namaz dogaanaa-dogaanaa hai"
"2050","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhaariba bin disaara ne mujh se kaha: Sa'id qausara bin Jubair ke bare mein Kya kehte the? Main ne kaha: bin Sa'id Abbas se bayan karte the, unhon ne kaha: Woh bahut bhalai hai muhaariba ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ki rae kahan hoti hai? Muhaariba ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn Umar ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab {Beshak Ham ne tumhen qausara di} nazil hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Woh jannat ki ek nahar hai, us ke kinare sone ke hain; moti-yaqoot par behti hai; us ki mitti mushk se zyada khushbudar hai, us ka zaeqa shehed se meetha hai, aur us ka pani barf se safed hai"
"2051","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhaariba bin disaara ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe, lakdi, roghan lage bartan aur ghare se mana kiya"
"2052","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, muhaariba se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Shab-Qadr ko Ramazan ke aakhri das mein talash karo"
"2053","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Musanna ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us par raham kare jo Asr se pahle chaar padhe"
"2054","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Bakr bin Abdullah aur Bishr bin Huzali Aaiz se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Resham Wahy pehenta hai jis ka koi hissa nahin"
"2055","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Khabbab se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Fazl ko suna — ya Fazl ke bete ko — Ibn Umar se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath baitha tha ke farmaya: Aey Allah, main tujh se mu'afi mangta hun aur Teri taraf Tauba karta hun; mujh par wapas, Beshak Tu qabool karne wala bakhshne wala hai agar koi kare to apne hath par sau martaba ginaye"
"2056","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Zazan ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Hamen batao Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha bartanon se mana kiya; hamen apni zuban mein batao aur hamari zuban mein samajhaao. unhon ne kaha: Lakdi se mana kiya, woh matakaa hai; aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya, woh taarakola laga hai; aur tumbe se mana kiya, woh kadduu hai; aur naqeer se mana kiya, woh khajoor ka thuuntha hai, khodakara khodaa jata hai, chiilakara chiilaa jata hai; aur hukm diya ke mashkizon mein nabeez banai jae"
"2057","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Najraana walon mein se ek aadmi ko suna, kehte hue: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Main tum sirf do ke bare mein poochta hun, khajooron mein peshagii ke bare mein, aur kishmish-khajoor ke bare mein to unhon ne kaha: Khajooron mein peshagii ka, ek aadmi ne kisi aadmi ki khajooron mein peshagii di, lekin us saal phal na aaye to is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya gaya, to farmaya: Woh us ka maal kaise khayega? Aur use hukm diya aur Us ne use diya phir khajooron mein peshagii se mana kiya yahan tak ke un ka pakna zahir ho aur kishmish-khajoor ka, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas nashay mein dhut aadmi laya gaya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne sharab nahin pi; Main ne sirf kishmish-khajoor pi hai to Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya aur use hadd lagai, aur un donon se mana kiya ke mila jaen"
"2058","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Shaibani khaliq se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye mashkize mein nabeez banai jati thi"
"2059","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah, Hisham aur Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yunus bin Jubair se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha Jis ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di, to unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko jante ho; Unhon ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di, to Umar ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to farmaya: Woh us se ruju' kare Hammad ne Qatadah se Yunus bin Jubair se apni hadees mein kaha, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Kya woh tum par ek talaq gini gayi? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan; Kya samajhte ho, agar Ibn Umar aaziza-bewaqoof ho to talaq na gini jae?."
"2060","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sauri Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib se, Kaseer bin jumahaana se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan masaaa mein paidal chalte dekha, to Main ne un se is ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Agar main paidal caluun to Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko paidal chalte dekha hai; aur agar main dauruun to Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko daudte dekha hai"
"2061","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ash-Sha'bi se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha Jis ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di, to unhon ne kaha: Woh talaq se iddat guzaaregii, us haiz se iddat na guzaaregii. main yeh Ibn Umar ke qaul se kehta hun, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"2062","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anbari Tauba se, unhon ne kaha: Ash-Sha'bi ne mujh se kaha: Hasan ka Kya, jabke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain? Allah ki qasam, main Madinah mein Ibn Umar ke sath izafa-izafa baitha, aur unhen Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek hadees ke siwa bayan karte nahin suna unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sahaba mein se logon mein the, aur gosht laya gaya to un ki biwiyon mein se ek ne kaha: Ruko, yeh goh hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khao, yeh halal hai — ya kaha: Khao, is mein koi harj nahin"
"2063","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anbari Tauba se, unhon ne kaha: Ijalii muvairriqa ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Mujhe Chasht ki namaz ki khabar den, Kya Aap use padhte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Kya Umar ne use padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Kya Abu Bakr ne use padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal nahin"
"2064","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Hafs bin Asim ko suna, Ibn Umar se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Mina mein do rak'aten padhain — ya kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mina mein do rak'aten padhin, Abu Bakr ne do rak'aten, Umar ne do rak'aten, Usman ne do rak'aten; phir Usman ne poori kiya"
"2065","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim bin Makki yannaaqa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko dekha, jabke Unhon ne Makkah mein ek aadmi ko apna izaar ghaseette dekha to kaha: Tum kinamen se ho? To Us ne apna nasab khabar, aur woh Bani Lais mein se rawana to Ibn Umar ne use pahacaanaa. to Ibn Umar ne un se kaha: apna izaar uthao; kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne in donon kaanon se farmate suna: Jo apna izaar ghaseete aur is se sirf takabbur chahe, to Allah Azza-wa Jall qayamat ke din use na dekhegaa."
"2066","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Badr ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sawwar bin Shabeeb ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah Ibn Umar se safar mein namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do-do rak'aten, siwae Maghrib ke"
"2067","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aqeel bin Talha se, unhon ne kaha: Abu khasiiba ko kehte suna: Main baitha tha ke Ibn Umar aae, aur ek aadmi apni jagah se un ke liye uthaa. to Ibn Umar ne us mein baithne se inkar kiya to woh aadmi kehne laga: Tumhen baithne mein Kya hai? Tumhen baithne mein Kya hai? To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Main tumhari ya kisi aur ki majlis mein na baithunga, jabase Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko suna, jabke ek aadmi aaya aur ek aadmi apni majlis se us ke liye utha, aur woh us mein baithna chahta tha; to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use is se mana kiya"
"2068","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais se, Ata se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke ek aurat Aap paas aaeen aur kaha: Aurat par shauhar ka haq Kya hai? To farmaya: Woh apne nafs se use na roke, chahe oont ki tayyar par ho; aur us ke ghar se koi cheez na de siwae us ki ijazat se; agar Us ne aisa kiya to us ke liye ajr hoga aur us par gunah hoga aur nafl roza na rakhe siwae us ki ijazat se; agar Us ne kiya to gunah hogi, ajr na paaegii. aur us ke ghar se na nikle siwae us ki ijazat se; agar Us ne kiya to farishte us par lanat karenge — gussa ke farishte aur rehmat ke farishte — yahan tak ke woh Tauba kare ya aur kaha gaya: Chahe woh zalim ho? Farmaya: Chahe woh zalim ho"
"2069","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, ke Abu salam ne bayan kiya, Hakam bin Mina ne bayan kiya, ke Abdullah Ibn Umar aur Abdullah Ibn Abbas ne bayan kiya ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne mimbar ki lakdi par farmate suna: Log Jume chhorne se zaroor poochhenge, ya un ke dilon par zaroor mohar lagegii, phir woh zaroor ghafilon mein likha jayenge"
"2070","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Aas ki aulaad mein se Qurashi Ishaq bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid Sa'id ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke paas tha ke ek aadmi un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Tum kinamen se ho? To us ne kaha: Aslam mein se ek aadmi to unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhen khushkhabri na dun, Aey Aslam ke bhai? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghifar, Allah use muaf kare; Aslam, Allah use samet rakhe"
"2071","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Mundhir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Ibn Umar ke bete ke sath bagh mein the, aur wahan pani mein oont ki khaal thi to Us ne us se wuzu kiya to main ne kaha: Kya tum aisa karte ho? To us ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya, farmaya: Jab pani do qulle ho, use koi cheez napak nahin karti"
"2072","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Muhammad bin Zaid bin Abdullah Ibn Umar se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Ibn Umar se kaha: Ham apne ameeron ke paas dakhil hote hain aur un ke samne kuch baat karte hain, jab nikalte hain to us ke siwa kehte hain to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ham Ise muqabla samajhte the Umari ne kaha: To mere bhai ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ham Ise Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein muqabla samajhte the"
"2073","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Yeh saltanat Quraish mein rahegi jab tak logon mein do aadmi bache hon"
"2074","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu misrii Tauba se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Sharab ke bare mein teen aayaat nazil huin sab pahle nazil hua: {Woh tum sharab-mein ke bare mein poochte hain} aayat to kaha gaya: Sharab haram hui to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, hamen us se nafa lene den jaisa Allah Azza-wa Jall ne kaha to Aap un se khamosh rahe phir yeh aayat nazil hui: {Namaz ke qareeb na jao jabke tum nashay mein ho}. to kaha gaya: Haram hui to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham use namaz ke qareeb nahin piite. to Aap un se khamosh rahe phir nazil hui: {Aey iman walon, sharab-juwa to} aayat to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sharab haram hui unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ke paas Sham se untni bhar — ya untniyan bhar — aai thin to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue, aur Abu Bakr, Umar — aur Usman ko un ke sath hi janta hun — aur us aadmi ke paas pahunche to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamare liye chhodo, ham use phoren. to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham use bechen nahin? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne sharab par lanat ki, us ke ugaane wale par lanat ki, us ke peene wale par lanat ki, us ke nicorane wale par lanat ki, use jagah dene wale par lanat ki, us ke pilane wale ke chakkar par lanat ki, us ke pilane wale par lanat ki, us ke uthane wale par lanat ki, us ki qeemat khane wale par lanat ki, us ke bechne wale par lanat ki"
"2075","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah aur Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin Abdullah bin Mauhab se, Ibn Umar se, ke Unhon ne ek aadmi se kaha: Tumhari jis baat ke bare mein Tum ne mujh se poocha: Kya Usman Badr mein hazir the? Woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti mein mashghool the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke liye un ka hissa kiya aur baiate-rizavaana ka, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Makkah walon ki taraf bheja tha; agar Usman se zyada moatabara koi Aap nazar mein hota to use bhejte; aur bai'at hui jabke Usman ghaaiba the to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera yeh hath Usman ke liye hai to ek hath doosre par mara aur do lashkar milne ke din un ke phirti ka, main gawahi deta hun ke Allah Azza-wa Jall ne unhen muaf kar diya yeh apne sath le jao"
"2076","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko suna, bayan karte hue ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain, jo mein hon, un se iman ki mithas pae; woh ke Allah-Rasulullah use un ke siwa se zyada mahboob hon; aur aadmi ka aag mein phenka jana use zyada mahboob ho is se ke woh kufr mein aae, baad is ke ke Allah ne use us se nijaat di; aur aadmi bande se muhabbat kare, us se sirf Allah ke liye muhabbat kare — ya kaha: Allah mein — donon mein se ek; Abu Dawud ko shak hua"
"2077","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein chand phataa."
"2078","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur dastuvaaii Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya Shu'bah ne kaha: Qatadah ne hamen khabar, aur Hisham ne kaha: Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na chuuta hai, na badashagunii; aur mujhe nek faal achcha hota hai kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, nek faal Kya hai? Farmaya: Achchi kalima"
"2079","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne hamen khabar, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gosht laya gaya, to farmaya: Yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh kuch hai jo Barirah ko sadqe mein diya gaya farmaya: Woh hamare liye hadiya hai, aur us par Sadqa hai"
"2080","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Nabi nahin magar Us ne apni ummat ko kaane-kazzab se ghabraya Khabardar, woh kana hai; aur Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala kana nahin hai; us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai, har mo'min use parhegaa."
"2081","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda nahin jis ke liye Allah ke paas bhalai ho, jo duniya mein jana pasand kare, siwae shaheed ke; kyunke woh jawab ke aae aur das martaba qatl ho, shahadat ki fazeelat dekhakara."
"2082","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az se farmaya: Jaan lo, jo mare aur gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur main Allah ka Rasulullah hun, woh jannat mein dakhil hoga"
"2083","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aag se woh niklega Jis ne kaha: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, jabke us ke dil mein jau ke dane barabar bhalai ho; aur aag se woh niklega Jis ne kaha: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, jabke us ke dil mein gehn ke dane barabar bhalai ho; aur aag se woh niklega Jis ne kaha: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, jabke us ke dil mein itni bhalai ho jo taule — Hisham ne kaha: Raaii ka dana — aur Shu'bah ne kaha: Sarason ka daanaa."
"2084","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall farmata hai: Agar mera banda mujh se balisht qareeb ho, main us se hath qareeb hota hun; aur agar woh mujh se hath qareeb ho, main us se do hath qareeb hota hun"
"2085","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do chitkabre seeng wale mendhon ki qurbani ki, Allah ka naam lekar takbir kehte hue; aur Main ne Aap dekha, Aap apne rukhasaara un ke pehluon par rakhe the"
"2086","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Ansar mein se ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne falan ko kaam diya aur mujhe kaam nahin diya to farmaya: Tum mere baad tarjeeh dekhoge; to sabr karo yahan tak ke hauz par mujh se miliye"
"2087","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sharab mein khajoor ki chariyon-jootiyon se hadd lagai; aur Abu Bakr ne chalis lagae jab Umar aae, aur log dehat-bastiyon se qareeb hue, to unhon ne kaha: Sharab ki hadd mein tumhari Kya rae hai? To Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne kaha: Meri rae hai ke use sab halki hudood jaisi karo to Umar ne assi lagae"
"2088","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi ke sahaba ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Ahle-Kitab hamen salam karte hain, to ham unhen jawab kaise den? Farmaya: Kaho: Tum par kiya"
"2089","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Zubair ko shagaaf qamees ki beemar di gayi"
"2090","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Abdur Rahman aur Zubair ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se joon ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne unhen shagaaf qamees ki beemar di Anas ne kaha: Donon ko Main ne shagaaf qamees pahne dekha"
"2091","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se jab ek apni namaz mein ho, woh apne Rabb se sargoshi karta hai; to apne samne na thooke, na apne daayen, lekin apne baayen aur apne pair ke niice."
"2092","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne hamein khabar di, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh un se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan; Ham ne un se is ke bare mein poocha unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche, Abu Bakr ke peeche, Umar ke peeche aur Usman ke peeche namaz padhi; woh {sab tareef Allah ke liye, jo jahanon ka Rabb hai} se shuru karte the"
"2093","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kadduu pasand karte the; jab Main ne yeh dekha to use Aap samne rakhne wahan"
"2094","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sajde mein seedhe raho; tum se koi apni kuhaniyaan na phailaye jaise kutta karta hai"
"2095","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne Ansar ki ek aurat se guthli bhar sone par nikah kiya; to Aap ne Ise jaiz rakha"
"2096","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Madinah mein Khawf hua, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abu Talha ke Mandub ek ghode par sawar hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Khawf na tha, aur Ham ne use samundar jaisa tez paya"
"2097","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah aur Abu Tayyah se: Donon ne Anas ko suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate hain: Main bheja gaya, main aur qayamat, in do tarah aur Qatadah ne badhaya: Ek ko doosri par koi fazeelat nahin"
"2098","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Anas ko suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek aadmi ke paas aae jo qurbani ka oont hank raha tha, to farmaya: Us par sawar ho us ne kaha: Woh qurbani ka oont hai farmaya: Us par sawar ho us ne kaha: Woh qurbani ka oont hai farmaya: Afsos tum par — ya: Tum par afsos — us par sawar ho"
"2099","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni safen seedhi karo; kyunke saf seedhi karna namaz ka hissa hai"
"2100","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Adam ke bete ke paas maal ki ek ghati ho to woh us ke sath doosri jawab; aur agar us ke paas doosri ho to us ke sath teesri jawab; aur Adam ke bete ka pet mitti ke siwa kuch nahin bharatii; aur Allah us ki Tauba qabool karta hai jo Tauba kare Anas ne kaha: Main nahin janta; koi cheez Aap par nazil hui thi, ya Aap kehte the"
"2101","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek hadees Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni, mere baad tum koi nahin bayan karega Jis ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna ho; Main ne Aap farmate suna: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke ilm uthega, jahalat phailegii, sharab pi jaegi, zina phailegaa, mard kam honge, aurten zyada hongi, yahan tak ke pachaas aurton par ek nigaraana hoga"
"2102","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman Hira par the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke raho; tum par Nabi, ya Siddiq, ya shaheed hi hain"
"2103","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke ek aurat ne ek laundi pakdi jis ke paas us ke zewar the, aur us ka sar do patthron ke darmiyan kuchla, aur zewar liye to yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas uthaya gaya, aur Aap ne us ka sar do patthron ke darmiyan kucalaa."
"2104","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Masjid mein thook gunah hai, aur us ka kaffara use dafan karna hai"
"2105","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Umm-Sulaim ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ke liye Allah se dua karen — ya'ni Anas ke liye farmaya: Aey Allah, us ka maal-aulaad farma, aur use barkat de jis mein Tu ne use rizq di"
"2106","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek Maheena qunut padhi, riala, Zakwan aur lihayaana par badaduaa karte hue"
"2107","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas shagaaf kapda laya gaya, aur woh us se karne hone lage to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ruumaala — ya kaha: Kuch ruumaala — Sa'd bin Mu'az ke jannat mein is se Narmi hain, ya is se behtar hain"
"2108","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Safiyyah ko aazad kiya, aur un ki aazad ko un ka meher banaya"
"2109","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main jannat mein tha ke ek nahar dekhi, to main ne kaha: Aey Jibreel, yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh qausara hai jo tumhare Rabb ne tumhen di to Main ne apna hath dala, aur us ki mitti tez mushk thi"
"2110","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere hauz ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan Sana-Madinah jitna hai, ya Madinah-ammaana jitna hai"
"2111","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gardan ki donon ragon aur gudi par pachhna nikalwate the"
"2112","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ruku-sajdah poora karo; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhen apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun jab tum ruku-sajdah karte ho"
"2113","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka Isha mein intezar kiya yahan tak ke aadhi raat guzar; phir Aap nikle aur hamen namaz padhai, goya main Aap hath mein chandi ki anguthi ki chamak dekh raha hun"
"2114","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kamil karte hue sab halki namaz padhne walon mein the"
"2115","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Musalman paudha na lagae — aur ek martaba kaha: Ya khajoor ka darakht — ya kheti na kare, aur us mein se janwar, insan ya parinda khae, magar us ke liye Sadqa hoga"
"2116","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main khajoor dekhta hun, aur mujhe us ke khane se sirf dar rokta hai ke woh sadqe ki khajooron mein se ho"
"2117","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khade peene se roka"
"2118","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the ke ek aadmi ko kehte suna: Allah ki bahut pak-tareef, paak wali jab Aap namaz se farigh hue to kaha: Tum se Kis ne aisi-aisi baat kahi? To qaum khamosh rahi, yahan tak ke teen martaba kaha to ek aadmi ne kaha: Main ne kahi, Ya Rasulullah, aur Main ne us se sirf bhalai chahi thi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne barah farishton ko dekha, woh use uthane ke liye daud yahan tak ke use uthe to Allah Tabaraka-Ta'ala ne farmaya: Use likho jaisa mere bande ne kaha; lekin Unhon ne apne Rabb se poocha ke use kaise likhen? Farmaya: Use likho jaisa mere bande ne kaha"
"2119","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke urainaa mein se log Madinah aae, aur unhen us ki aabohavaa napasand hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke liye oonton aur un ke charwahe ka hukm diya, aur unhen hukm diya ke un ke doodh-peshab mein se to unhon ne kaha: To woh mote hue yahan tak ke bahut sehatmand hue; phir Unhon ne charwahe ko qatl kiya, aur oonton ko haankaa. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki talash mein bheja, aur woh jane gaye to Aap ne un ke hath-pair kaate, un ki aankhen phoriin, aur unhen dhoop mein dala yahan tak ke woh hue"
"2120","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah, Ali bin Zaid aur Suhaib ke bete Abdul-Aziz se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min pahunchne wali takleef se maut ki tamanna na kare; agar zaroor kehna ho to kahe: Aey Allah, mujhe zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho, aur mujhe wafat de jab wafat mere liye behtar ho"
"2121","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se koi iman na pahunchayega yahan tak ke apne bhai ke liye woh pasand kare jo apne liye pasand karta hai"
"2122","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Adam ka beta buddha hota hai aur us se do jawan hoti hain; maal ki hirs, aur lambi umar ki khvaahisha."
"2123","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sahar karo; kyunke sahar mein barkat hai"
"2124","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun bekaara ilm se, na chadhne wale amal se, na darne wale dil se, aur na suni jane wali dua se"
"2125","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun bars, paagalapana, korha aur buri beemariyon se"
"2126","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Umm-Sulaim ne mujhe tokri mein taza khajooron par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf bheja to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mutthi pakadte apni biwiyon ko bhejane lage, phir baqi khaya, us aadmi ke khane ki tarah jise jana jae ke woh use shauqa se chahta hai"
"2127","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min qayamat ke din jama kiye jaenge aur us ke liye Allahumma honge kahenge: Kaash ham apne Rabb Azza-wa Jall se sifarish mangne yahan tak ke hamen is jagah se qailula de to woh Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Aey Adam, tum logon ke baap ho; Allah ne tumhen apne hath se paida kiya, tumhare liye apne farishton se sajdah karaya, aur tumhen har cheez ke naam sikhaye; hamare liye apne Rabb se sifarish karo yahan tak ke hamen is jagah se qailula de to kahenge: Main is ke qaabila nahin — aur unhen apna gunah yaad dilaaenge jo Unhon ne kiya — lekin Nuh ke paas jao, pahle Rasulullah jinhein Allah ne zameen ki taraf bheja to woh Nuh ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Main is ke qaabila nahin — aur unhen apna gunah yaad dilaaenge jo Unhon ne kiya — lekin Rahman ke Khaleel Ibrahim ke paas jao to woh Ibrahim ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Main is ke qaabila nahin — aur unhen apne gunah yaad dilaaenge jo Unhon ne kiye — lekin Musa ke paas jao, banda jinhein Allah ne Taurat di aur un se hamakalaama hua to woh Musa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Main is ke qaabila nahin — aur unhen apna gunah yaad dilaaenge jo Unhon ne kiya — lekin Isa ke paas jao, Allah ke bande-Rasulullah, Allah ke kalimat aur ruuha. to woh Isa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Main is ke qaabila nahin, lekin Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jao; banda jin ke Allah ne agle-pichhle gunah muaf kiye to woh mere paas aayenge, aur main caluungaa; apne Rabb se ijazat maanguungaa, aur mujhe ijazat di jayegi jab main apne Rabb Tabaraka-Ta'ala ko dekhuungaa to sajde mein giruungaa, aur mujhe jitna jawab chhod dega phir kaha jaega: Uthao Muhammad, kaho suni jaegi, mango liye, sifarish karo qabool hogi to main apne Rabb ki un taariifon se tareef karunga jo woh mujhe sikhaaegaa, phir sifarish karunga, aur mere liye hadd muqarrar ki jaegi, aur main unhen jannat mein dakhil karunga phir lautuungaa, aur jab apne Rabb ko dekhuungaa to us ke liye sajde mein giruungaa, aur mujhe jitna Allah jawab chhod dega to kaha jaega: Uthao Muhammad, kaho suni jaegi, mango liye, sifarish karo qabool hogi to main apne Rabb ki un taariifon se tareef karunga jo woh mujhe sikhaaegaa, phir sifarish karunga aur mere liye hadd muqarrar ki jaegi, aur main unhen jannat mein dakhil karunga phir lautuungaa, aur jab apne Rabb ko dekhuungaa to us ke liye sajde mein giruungaa, aur mujhe jitna Allah jawab chhod dega phir kaha jaega: Uthao Muhammad, kaho suni jaegi, mango liye, sifarish karo qabool hogi to main apne Rabb ki un taariifon se tareef karunga jo woh mujhe sikhaaegaa, phir sifarish karunga, aur mere liye hadd muqarrar ki jaegi, aur main unhen jannat mein dakhil karunga yahan tak ke lautuungaa aur kahunga: Aey Rabb, aag mein Wahy bache jinhein Quran ne roka — ya'ni jin par hamesha rehna wajib hua"
"2128","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall mo'min ki neki mein zulm nahin karta; use duniya mein us par rizq ka sawab diya jata hai, aur aakhirat mein us ka badla diya jata hai aur kafir ko duniya mein us se bharapuura diya jata hai; jab qayamat ka din hoga to us ki koi neki na hogi"
"2129","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min ko jannat mein itni-itni aurton ki taqat di jayegi kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh is ki taqat rakhega? Farmaya: Use sau mardon ki taqat di jayegi"
"2130","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har insan ke teen sathi hain ek sathi kehta hai: Jo kharch kiya woh Tera, aur jo roka woh Tera nahin; woh us ka maal hai aur ek sathi kehta hai: Main Tere sath hun; jab Tu Badshah ke darwaze par aayega to tumhein chhodkar lautuungaa; woh us ke ghar wale aur khadim-caakara hain aur ek sathi kehta hai: Main Tere sath hun jahan Tu dakhil ho aur jahan Tu nikle; woh us ka amal hai to kehta hai: Tu teenon mein sab halka tha mujh par — ya kaha: Tum par"
"2131","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin Hasan se, Abu Hurairah se; aur Abu Awanah se, Qatadah se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Tum pahle walon mein teen aadmi nikle, apne gharwalon ke liye caaraagaaha dhuundhate hue; unhen baarish ne pakda, aur woh pahaad ki taraf panah liye to un par pathar gaya to mein se ek ne doosre se kaha: Nishan mita, tum dekhte ho pathar gira, aur tumhari jagah Allah ke siwa koi nahin janta; to Allah se apne mazboot aamal se dua karo to mein se ek ne kaha: Aey Allah, agar Tu janta hai ke mere walidain the, aur main un ke liye un ke bartan mein doodh dohataa tha; jab main un ke paas aata jabke woh soe hote, to khada rehta yahan tak ke woh jaagen, jab jaagen; aur napasand karta ke un ki uungha un ke siron mein kiya; jab woh jagte to piite. agar Tu janta hai ke Main ne yeh sirf Teri rehmat ki ummeed aur Tere azab ke dar se kiya, to ham se khola. unhon ne kaha: To pathar ka tihai gaya unhon ne kaha: Aur doosre ne kaha: Aey Allah, agar Tu janta hai ke ek aurat thi jo mujhe bhaatii thi, lekin Us ne apne nafs par mujhe qaboo na diya yahan tak ke Main ne us ke liye qeemat rakhi jab Main ne use pakda to us ke nafs-qeemat ko poora rakha agar Tu janta hai ke Main ne yeh sirf Tere azab ke dar aur Teri rehmat ki ummeed se kiya, to ham se khola. unhon ne kaha: To doosra tihai gaya aur teesre ne kaha: Aey Allah, agar Tu janta hai ke Main ne mazdoor kiraye par liya, mere liye ek din kaam kare; to Us ne kaam kiya jab raat hui to Main ne use us ki kharch di, lekin Us ne use napasand kiya aur na liya to Main ne us ki kharch li, aur us par badhaya yahan tak ke tamam maal mein se hua phir woh mere paas apni kharch mangne aaya, to main ne kaha: Yeh sab le, Tera hai; agar main chahta to use sirf us ki kharch deta agar Tu janta hai ke Main ne yeh sirf Teri rehmat ki ummeed aur Tere azab ke dar se kiya, to ham se khola. unhon ne kaha: To aakhri tihai hata, aur woh chalti nikle"
"2132","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qattan Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha ne mujhe lagaye jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan the; aur mujhe us se mana nahin kiya gaya"
"2133","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek Maheena qunut padhi, aur Arab ke qabilon mein se ek qabeela par badaduaa ki, phir use chhod"
"2134","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke aadmi khade piie. to Main ne Anas se kaha: Khade tak tumhara Kya kehna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh fajir hai"
"2135","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein chaar ne Quran jama kiya; Ubayy bin Ka'b, Mu'az, Zaid bin Sabit aur Abu zaida. unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se kaha: Abu Zaid kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Mere chachaon mein se ek"
"2136","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ka Kya hai jo namaz mein nazar uthate hain? Is bare mein Aap baat sakht hui yahan tak ke farmaya: Woh is se zaroor poochhenge, ya un ki nazar chheen li jayegi"
"2137","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka katib tha jab Aap use samiiama-basiiraa likhavaate to woh samiiana-aliimaa likhta; aur jab samiiana-aliimaa hota to samiiama-basiiraa likhta Us ne Baqarah-Aal-Imran padhi thin, aur Jis ne unhen padha Us ne bahut Quran padha unhon ne kaha: Woh aadmi Nasrani hua aur kaha: Main Muhammad ke paas jo chahta tha likhta tha unhon ne kaha: Woh mara aur dafan hua, lekin zameen ne use ugalaa; phir dafan hua aur zameen ne use ugalaa. Anas ne kaha: Abu Talha ne kaha: Main ne use zameen ki peeth par pada dekha"
"2138","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha bin Amr ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit ko suna, Anas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas nikalte jabke Maghrib ki azan ho chuki hoti aur ham do rak'aten padh rahe hote; na hamen hukm dete na mana karte"
"2139","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakam bin Atiyyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jis par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umm-Salamah se nikah kiya, woh aisi cheez thi jis ki qeemat das dirham thi"
"2140","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Abahh Yahya ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki misaal baarish jaisi hai; nahin jana jata us ka awwal behtar hai ya aakhira."
"2141","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Azza-wa Jall ne Adam ki tasweer banai to unhen jitna chaha chhore rakha to ibaliisa un ke gird chakkar lagane laga, unhen dekhta hua jab unhen khokhalaa dekha to jana ke woh aisi makhlooq hain jo beqaabuu hain"
"2142","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein sab bahadur the"
"2143","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakam — ya Usman — ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Shafa'at meri ummat ke Kabeera walon ke liye hai"
"2144","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas dakhil hue jabke ham sirf main, meri walida aur meri khala Umm-haram the to farmaya: Khade ho, main tumhen namaz parhaauun. to hamen bevaqta namaz padhai Sabit se ek aadmi ne kaha: Anas ko kahan kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Unhen apne daayen kiya jab Aap namaz se farigh hue to hamare liye — gharwalon ke liye — duniya-aakhirat ki har bhalai ki dua ki to meri walida ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aapka chhota khadim; us ke liye Allah se dua karen unhon ne kaha: To mere liye har bhalai ki dua ki; aakhir mein mere liye jo dua ki woh thi: Aey Allah, us ka maal-aulaad farma, aur use us mein barkat de Abu Dawud ne kaha: Unhon ne zikr kiya ke Anas ne kaha: Meri sulba se assi paida hue"
"2145","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ki iqamat ho to khade na ho yahan tak ke mujhe dekho"
"2146","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Meri phuphi ka beta Harisah Badr ke din tamaashaaii ladke ke taur par nikla; ladne nahin nikla tha, aur use teer laga aur use qatl kiya to un ki walida Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, agar Harisah jannat mein ho to sabr karungi, aur agar us ke siwa ho to tum dekhoge main Kya karti hun to farmaya: Aey Harisah ki walida, jannaten bahut hain; Harisah sab uunce Firdaus mein hai"
"2147","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kisi ke peeche Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se halki namaz nahin padhi, kamil karte hue Abu Bakr ki namaz qareeb thi; jab Umar the to Fajr lambi ki"
"2148","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne hamare liye pyala nikali aur kaha: Main ne is mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mashroob pilaya; pani, shehed, doodh aur nabiiza."
"2149","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughirah aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki paas karta tha ek din paas ki, aur jab paas se farigh hua aur apni walida ki taraf wapas, to bachchon ko khelte dekha to un ke khel ko dekhne khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas aae, unhen salam kiya, phir mujhe bulaya aur mujhe apne kisi kaam mein bheja, aur chhaon mein baithe yahan tak ke main un ke paas aaya aur main apni walida se us waqt se der hua jis mein main un ke paas aata tha to unhon ne kaha: Aey bete, tumhen Kis ne roka? To Main ne unhen khabar di to unhon ne kaha: Woh Kya hai jis mein Us ne tumhen bheja? To main ne kaha: Aey ammii, woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka raaz hai to unhon ne kaha: Aey bete, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke raaz ki hifazat karo to Main ne use logon mein se kisi ko nahin khabar; agar main kisi ko bayan wala hota to tumhen batata, Aey saabita."
"2150","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Anas ke paas the ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main aaj kuch nahin pahchanta jo main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein pahchanta tha unhon ne kaha: Aey Abu Hamzah, namaz? Unhon ne kaha: Kya Tum ne namaz mein woh nai baat nahin dali jo dali?."
"2151","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah hamla karte the aur sunte the; agar azan sunte to rukte, warna hamla karte"
"2152","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, ke Ansari Abbad bin Bishr aur Ansari Usaid bin huzaira Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ghane andhere ki raat mein namaz ke liye nikle — ya'ni andherii. jab woh apne gharon ko aae to un ke samne roshan hui, yahan tak ke jab woh juda hone lage to mein se har ek ke sath roshan hui"
"2153","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahut dua karte the; kehte the: Aey Allah, Aey hamare Rabb, hamen duniya mein bhalai de, aakhirat mein bhalai de, aur hamen aag ke azab se bacha Shu'bah ne kaha: To Main ne is ka zikr Qatadah se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Anas is se dua karte the, marfu' nahin karte the"
"2154","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roza rakhte yahan tak ke kaha jata: Roza rakhta hai, roza rakhta hai; aur iftar karte yahan tak ke kaha jata: Iftar kiya, iftar kiya"
"2155","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Yaman wale Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare sath Mu'az bin Jabal ko bhejen, hamen hamare Rabb ki Kitab aur hamare Nabi ki sunnat sikhayen to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Ubaidah Jarrah ka hath pakda aur farmaya: Yeh is ummat ke ameen hain to unhen un ke sath bheja"
"2156","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Woh hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ka bayan karte the: Jab Aap ruku se sar uthate to khade rehte yahan tak ke ham kehte: Bhool gae, lamba qiyam se"
"2157","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sabr pehli cota par hai"
"2158","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Murrii Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki masajid aabad karne wale Allah Azza-wa Jall wale hain"
"2159","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bishr ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aurton ke kamaron mein khushbu talash karte the"
"2160","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Jume ke din baat ki jati thi jab Aap mimbar se utarte the"
"2161","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Aurten Uhud ke din mashkize lekar dakhil hoti thin"
"2162","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Mere Anas aae bin maamuun Nazr — jin ke naam par mera naam rakha gaya woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Badr mein hazir na the, aur yeh un par bhaari guzra aur kaha: Pehla maarakaa jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hazir hue, main us se ghaaiba raha; Khabardar, Allah ki qasam, agar Allah ne mujhe is ke baad maarakaa dikhaayaa to Allah zaroor dekhega main Kya karta hun unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne is se zyada kehne se dar khaya jab agle saal Uhud ka din hua to hazir hue, aur Sa'd bin Mu'az ko peeche hote dekha to kaha: Kahan, Aey Abu Amr? Jannat ki khushbu Uhud se pahle pata hun to lade yahan tak ke maare gae; mein assi se zyada pae gae; maar, neza aur teer ke tak to un ki bahan Nazr ki beti rubayyia ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne apne bhai ko sirf ungli se pahchana; woh khubsurat ungli wale the unhon ne kaha: Yeh aayat nazil hui: {Momineen mein se mard hain jo Allah se kiye wa'de mein sachche utre} aayat Anas ne kaha: Ham samajhte the woh mein nazil hui"
"2163","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par museebat bhaari hui to Fatimah ne kaha: Hae musiibata. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aaj ke baad tumhare walid par koi museebat nahin"
"2164","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umarah bin Zazan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham Sabit ke paas the, aur un ke paas ek shaikh the to Ham ne donon Eidain mein padhi jane wali ka zikr kiya to shaikh ne kaha: Main Eid ke din Anas bin Malik ke sath zaaviyaa tak sath gaya, aur un ka ek aazad-karda unhen padha raha tha to Us ne {apne buland Rabb ke naam ki paki bayan karo} aur {raat ki qasam jab ghalib} padhin to Anas ne kaha: Us ne woh do suraten padhin jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eid mein padhte the"
"2165","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua mein hath uthate the yahan tak ke thaile ki safedi dikhatii thi Shu'bah ne kaha: To Main ne is ka Ali bin zikr Zaid se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Woh sirf istisqa mein hai main ne kaha: Tum ne yeh Anas se suna? To unhon ne kaha: Subhaanallaaha."
"2166","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Anjashaa aurton ke liye hadi padhte the, aur baraaa mardon bin Malik ke liye hadi padhte the anjashaa khubsurat awaz wale the, aur jab hadi padhte to oont tez hote to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afsos tum par, Aey anjashaa; shiishon ko aahista hankao"
"2167","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nabi Talha (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas un ki us beemari mein dakhil hue jis mein Aap wafat hui, to farmaya: Apni qaum ko salam pahuncaao; kyunke woh daman sabr wale hain"
"2168","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Sab pahle logon ko jama karne wali aag hogi, unhen Mashriq se Maghrib tak jama karegi"
"2169","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jannat ki sab pehli khuraaka machhli ki kaleji ka tukda hogi"
"2170","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Yahud ki aurat jab haiz wali hoti to na us ke sath khate the, na us ke sath peete the, na ghar mein us ke sath rehte the to Allah Azza-wa Jall ne nazil kiya: {Aur woh tum haiz ke bare mein poochte hain, kaho woh gandagi hai} us ke qaul tak: {Yahan tak ke woh pak hon}. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke un ke sath khao, un ke sath piyo, gharon mein un ke sath raho, aur jo chaho karo siwae humbistari ke to Yahud ne kaha: Yeh aadmi hamari kisi baat ko nahin chhodna chahta magar hamari mukhalifat karta hai to Usaid bin huzaira aur Abbad aae bin Bishr, aur Yahud ki baat mein se is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham un se humbistari na karen? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chehra badal gaya yahan tak ke Ham ne samjha Aap un se ghadabnak hue to woh Aap paas se nikle; phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas doodh ka hadiya aaya, aur Aap ne un ke peeche bheja yahan tak ke unhen doodh pilaya; to Ham ne samjha Aap un se ghadabnak nahin hue"
"2171","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do aadmi Allah Azza-wa Jall ke liye muhabbat na karen magar mein afzal woh hai jo apne sathi se zyada muhabbat rakhe"
"2172","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Safiyyah ko saat siron ke badle khareeda"
"2173","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughirah, Hammad bin Salamah aur Ja'far bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya — sab — Sabit se, Anas se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur hamen shaikh ne Anas bin bayan kiya Jis ne Nazr se suna — aur mein se kuch ki hadees kuch mein dakhil hui — unhon ne kaha: Anas ke walid Malik ne apni biwi Sulaim ki walida — jo Anas ki walida hain — se kaha: Yeh aadmi — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) — sharab haram karte hain to woh chala yahan tak ke Sham aaya aur wahan halaak hua phir Abu aae Talha aur Sulaim ki walida se paigham diya, aur un se is mein baat ki to unhon ne kaha: Abu Aey Talha, tumhare jaisa diya nahin jata, lekin tum kafir mard ho, aur main Musalman aurat hun; tumhen mujh se nikah karna mere liye jaiz nahin to unhon ne kaha: Yeh tumhari Sallallahu nahin unhon ne kaha: Meri Sallallahu Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Zard-safed maala. unhon ne kaha: Main na zard chahti hun na safed, tum Islam chahti hun unhon ne kaha: Mujhe woh kaun dilaaegaa? Unhon ne kaha: Tumhen woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dilaaenge. to Abu Nabi Talha (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf chale, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sahaba mein baithe the jab Aap dekha to farmaya: Tumhare paas Abu aae Talha, un ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan Islam ki roshan hai to woh aae, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko woh khabar jo Sulaim ki walida ne kaha tha to Aap ne un se us par nikah kiya Sabit ne kaha: Hamen nahin pahunchi ke koi meher us se bada tha; Unhon ne Islam ko meher maanaa. to un se nikah kiya; woh khubsurat aankhon wali aurat thin, mein kamaumrii thi woh un ke sath thin yahan tak ke un ke yahan beta paida hua, jis se Abu sakht Talha muhabbat karte the bachcha beemar hua, aur Abu Talha us ki beemari se aajiz — ya us ke liye tuute. to Abu Nabi Talha (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf chale, aur bachcha mar gaya to Sulaim ki walida ne kaha: Abu Talha ko koi un ke bete ki khabar na de, yahan tak ke main hi unhen un ki khabar dun to Unhon ne bachche ko tayyar kiya aur litaayaa. aur Abu Rasulullah Talha (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se aae yahan tak ke un ke paas dakhil hue to kaha: Mera beta kya hai? To unhon ne kaha: Abu Aey Talha, jabase woh beemar hua, is waqt se shaanta na tha unhon ne kaha: To Allah ki tareef hai to woh un ke paas raat ka khana din, aur Unhon ne us mein se khaya phir hui, khushbu lagai aur un ke samne aaeen, aur Unhon ne un se humbistari ki jab jana ke Unhon ne khaya aur un se humbistari ki, to kaha: Abu Aey Talha, batao, agar qaum ne qaum ko apni qarz cheez qarz di ho, phir Unhon ne use manga, Kya unhen rokna jaiz tha? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne tumhen tumhara beta qarz diya tha, phir use apni taraf qabz kiya; to apne bete ka sawab samjho aur sabr karo to woh gussa hue, phir kaha: Tum ne mujhe chhoda yahan tak ke jab main us mein pada jis mein pada, to mujhe mere bete ki khabar di phir subah Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gae aur Aap bataya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah tum donon ko tumhari guzar raat mein barkat de to us se hamal guzari Sulaim ki walida Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar karti thin; jab Aap nikalte to Aap sath nikalatiin, jab Aap dakhil hote to Aap sath dakhil hoti thin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab woh janam to mere paas bachche ko aao Madinah ke qareeb raat mein unhen dard hua, aur kaha: Aey Allah, main dakhil hoti thi jab Tere Nabi dakhil hote, nikalti thi jab Tere Nabi nikalte, aur yeh muamla aaya hai to ladka janiin, aur apne bete Anas se kaha: Bachche ko lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jao to Anas ne bachche ko liya aur use lekar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gae, jabke Aap oont-bakri khujate rahe the jab Aap dekha to Anas se kaha: Kya milhaana ki beti janiin? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to hath ki cheez dekha, bachche ko liya aur kaha: Mere paas ajavaa khajur aao to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajur li aur bachche ko ghuttii dene lage, aur bachcha cabaane wahan to farmaya: Ansar ki khajoor se muhabbat dekho to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use ghuttii di aur us ka naam Abdullah rakha Sabit ne kaha: Woh nek Musalmanon mein kare jate the"
"2174","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid bin Jud'an se, Anas bin Malik se, ke Room ke Badshah ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sundusa ka mustaqaa hadiya diya, aur Aap ne use pahanaa. goya main Aap than ko hilate dekh raha hun to Aap sahaba use chhoone lage aur kehne lage: Yeh tum par aasman se utara gaya to farmaya: Tum is se Kya karne hote ho; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, jannat mein Sa'd bin Mu'az ke ruumaalon mein se ek ruumaala is se Narmi hai phir use Ja'far ki taraf bheja, aur Unhon ne use pahna, phir aaye to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhen yeh pahanne ke liye nahin diya unhon ne kaha: Main is se Kya karun? Farmaya: Ise apne bhai Najashi ki taraf bhejo."
"2175","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Tum se koi maut ki tamanna na kare; agar zaroor karna ho to kahe: Aey Allah, mujhe zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho, aur mujhe wafat de jab wafat mere liye behtar ho"
"2176","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke woh Fajr ki namaz se pahle ek Maheena Fatimah ke darwaze se guzarte the aur farmate the: Namaz, Aey ghar walon; {Allah to yahi chahta hai ke tum naapaakii door kare, Aey ghar walon}."
"2177","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab mujhe meraaja karai gayi to aise logon par aaya jin ke honth aag ki qainciyon se kaate ja rahe the main ne kaha: Aey Jibreel, yeh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh tumhari ummat ke khateeb hain"
"2178","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhaib ke bete Abdul-Aziz se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hue, farmaya: Jis ne duniya mein resham pahna, woh aakhirat mein na pahanegaa."
"2179","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhaib ke bete Abdul-Aziz se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se koi pahunchne wali takleef se maut ki tamanna na kare; agar zaroor karna ho to kahe: Aey Allah, mujhe zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho, aur mujhe wafat de jab wafat mere liye behtar ho"
"2180","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhaib ke bete Abdul-Aziz se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se janaza guzra, aur Unhon ne us ki achchi tareef ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wajib hui aur doosra janaza guzra, aur Unhon ne us ki buri tareef ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wajib hui to Umar ne un se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya wajib hui? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum zameen par Allah ke gawah ho; jis ki Tum ne achchi tareef ki, us ke liye jannat wajib hui; aur jis ki Tum ne buri tareef ki, us ke liye aag wajib hui"
"2181","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd bin waris ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Aziz se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke aadmi za'fran lagae"
"2182","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakam bin Atiyyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aziz ya Sabit se — Abu Dawud ko shak hua — Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Muhajireen-Ansar ki taraf nikalte the; mein se koi apni hibbaa na kholta tha siwae Abu Bakr aur Umar ke; Aap un ki taraf muskurate aur woh Aap taraf muskurate the"
"2183","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Taimi se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Do aadmiyon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chheenka; to Aap ne ek ko Yarhamukallah kaha, doosre ko na kaha to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Ise Yarhamukallah kaha aur mujhe na kaha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne Allah kaha, to Main ne use Yarhamukallah kaha; aur Tum ne Allah nahin kaha, to Main ne tumhen Yarhamukallah nahin kaha"
"2184","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Zaid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne marruza-zaharaana mein khargosh bhagaya; to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba us ke peeche daud aur thak gaye aur Main ne use paya aur use pathar se zabah kiya to use Abu Talha ke paas laya, aur Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf us mein se raan — ya donon pichhli taangen — bhejin; to Aap ne use khaya — main ne kaha: Kya Aap ne use khaya? Unhon ne kaha: Use qabool kiya"
"2185","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Zaid ne mujhe khabar di, Anas se, ke Ansar ki ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen, Aap se kisi cheez mein baat karti huin; aur Aap se tanhai ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum log mujhe sab mahboob ho — unhon ne kaha: Ya'ni ansaara."
"2186","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Zaid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar qayamat khadi ho aur tum se ek ke hath mein khajoor ki qalam ho, aur woh taqat rakhe ke qayamat na aae yahan tak ke use lagae, to lagae"
"2187","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Zaid se, Anas se, ke Ahle-Kitab mein se ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kiya aur kaha: Maut tumhen. to Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya main us ki gardan marna? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ahle-Kitab tumhen salam karen to kaho: Tum par kiya"
"2188","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Zaid se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne janwar bandh nishana banane se mana kiya"
"2189","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin Anas ne mujhe khabar di, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum jante jo main janta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote"
"2190","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Rashid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Musa bin Anas se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khizab kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us hadd tak na pahunche ke khizab karen; lekin Abu Bakr mehndi-katama se khizab karte the"
"2191","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Bakr bin Anas se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne raham par farishta muqarrar kiya hai; woh kehta hai: Aey Rabb, Nutfa; Aey Rabb, alaqaa; Aey Rabb, muzaghaa. phir jab Allah Azza-wa Jall us ki khalqata poori karna chahe to kehta hai: Aey Rabb, ladka ya ladki, kisi ya khushabakhta? To yeh walidah ke pet mein likha jata hai"
"2192","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Bakr se, Anas se, ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kisi kamre mein jhaanka, jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas teer ki nok thi Anas ne kaha: Main ne Aap dekha, chupke se use godne ke liye hilate the"
"2193","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Kabeera ke bare mein poocha gaya, to farmaya: Allah se shirk, walidain ki nafarmani, jaan ka qatl, aur jhooti gawahi — ya: Jhooti kalima"
"2194","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Asamm se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko suna, jabke un se namaz mein ruku-sajde ki takbir ke bare mein poocha gaya, to kaha: Takbir kehta jab ruku kare, jab uthe, jab sajdah kare, aur jab do rak'aton se uthe. unhon ne kaha: Kis se? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Abu Bakr se, aur Umar se to Hakim ne un se kaha: aur Usman se? Unhon ne kaha: Aur Usman se"
"2195","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Rahman se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar ki taraf sundusa ka kapda bheja to Umar Aap paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne mere paas yeh bheja, jabke Aap ne woh kaha tha! Ya'ni: Resham ke bare mein to farmaya: Main ne tumhen pahanne ke liye nahin bheja, lekin nafa uthao ya qeemat chalo"
"2196","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salamah ke bete Abdul-Aziz ne ham se bayan kiya: Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Sulaim ki walida ke ghar dakhil hote the aur un ke bistar par sote the, jabke woh wahan na hoti thin unhon ne kaha: Ek din woh aaeen, aur un se kaha gaya: Yeh rahe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tumhare bistar par to woh Aap paas pahunchin jabke Aap sakht pasiinaa aaya tha, woh garmi mein tha to Unhon ne shiishii li aur us paseene mein se lekar shiishii mein dalne lageen to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jage aur farmaya: Kya karti ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap barkat; use apni khushbu mein dalte hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne durust kiya"
"2197","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Abdullah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Hunain ke din Hawazin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par aurat-bachche-oont-bakriyon par chadhkar aaeen; to us din Musalman bhaage. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us din farmane lage: Aey Hawazin, Aey Musalmanon ki jama'at, Muhajireen-Ansar, main Allah ka banda-Rasulullah hun; Aey Musalmanon ki jama'at, meri taraf aao; main Allah ka banda-Rasulullah hun to Allah ne mushrikon ko shikast di baghair neza maare ya teer calaae. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us din farmaya: Jo mushrik ko qatl kare, us ka salb usi ka hai to Abu Talha ne us din bees aadmi qatl kiye aur un ke salb liye Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne ek aadmi par hamla kiya aur us ki kandhe ki nas par mara, lekin main us se hata diya gaya, aur us par zirah hai; dekho Kis ne use liya to ek aadmi ne kaha: Main ne use liya, Ya Rasulullah; mujhe den aur use us mein se razi karen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuch na manga jata tha magar dete the, ya khamosh rehte the to Umar ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, Allah use apne sheron mein se ek sheir par dega, phir ham tumhen dete to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umar ne sach kaha unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha ne Sulaim ki walida ke paas khanjara dekha, to kaha: Is se Kya karti ho? Unhon ne kaha: Chahti hun ke mushrikon mein se koi qareeb aae to us ka pet phaaruun. to Abu Talha ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hanse aur farmaya: Aey Sulaim ki walida, Allah ne kafi kiya aur achcha kiya to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Inhen qatl karo, yeh tumhen lekar bhaagenge."
"2198","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam bin Yahya ne ham se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Abdullah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: {Tum neki na paoge} aayat, to Abu Rasulullah Talha (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Main dekhta hun Allah ham se qarz mangta hai; main tumhen gawah karta hun ke ariihaa mein meri zameen Sadqa hai; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use jahan chahen rakhen to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use apne rishtedaron mein rakho unhon ne kaha: To use Hassan bin Sabit aur Ubayy bin Ka'b ke darmiyan bagh bana"
"2199","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail bin Abdullah bin Talha se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kabhi nahin dekha ke Aap khushbu pesh ki gayi ho aur Aap ne use diya ho"
"2200","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ansari Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hafs bin Ubaidullah bin Anas ne mujhe khabar di, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein se kuch log bhalai ki kunjiyaan aur burayi ke taale hain; aur logon mein se kuch log burayi ki kunjiyaan aur bhalai ke taale hain to Tooba use jis ki bhalai ki kunjiyaan us ke hath par hon, aur afsos use jis ki burayi ki kunjiyaan us ke hath par hon"
"2201","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hurmuz ke aazad-karda Attab ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apne is hath se sunne-maanane par bai'at ki, jitna kar Aap"
"2202","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Attab se: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mujh par jaan jhoot bandha, woh jahannam mein apna guzarne bana"
"2203","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah, Shu'bah aur Abd bin waris ne ham se bayan kiya — mein sab achchi hadees wale — sab hamen Abu Tayyah se bayan karte the, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Madinah aae to us ke uunce hisse mein Ansar ke qabeela mein utre, kaha jata bin Amr bin jinhein Auf hai to mein chaudah raat rahe phir najjaara ke beton ki taraf bheja, aur woh talwaren latkaye aaye Anas ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni sawari par dekha, Aap peeche Abu Bakr the to chale yahan tak ke Abu Ansari Ayyub ke sehan mein utre to farmaya: Aey najjaara ke beton, apni is deewar ki mere hath qeemat lagao unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, ham us ki qeemat sirf Allah-Rasulullah se lenge — ya kaha: Ham us ki qeemat sirf Allah-Rasulullah lenge. unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte the jahan namaz pate the, aur bakri ke baaron mein namaz padhte the Anas ne kaha: Us mein woh tha jo main tum kehta hun; us mein khajur thin — Hammad ne kaha: Aur kheti; Abd bin waris ne kaha: Viiraanaa — aur mushrikon ki qabren thin to khajooron ka hukm diya aur woh tode gayin, mushrikon ki qabron ka hukm diya aur woh khodii gayin, khandar ka hukm diya aur woh hamavaara kiya gaya to khajooron ko masjid ka qibla banaya to woh pathar uthane aur rajaza padhne lage, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke sath the"
"2204","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Tayyah se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aasani karo, sakhti na karo; khushkhabri do, nafrat na bhagao"
"2205","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Tayyah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Zarr se farmaya: Suno-maano, chahe Habshi ke liye jis ka sar kishmish jaisa ho"
"2206","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Tayyah se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein hai"
"2207","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Tayyah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ham se ghul-milte the yahan tak ke mere chhote bhai se kehte the: Aey Umair ke baap, nughaira ne Kya kiya?."
"2208","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Tayyah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hue, farmaya: Main bheja gaya, main aur qayamat, in do jaisi — aur kalaam-darmiyan wali ungli se ishara kiya"
"2209","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghode se gire, aur Aapka dayan pahlu Aap to baithkar namaz padhi, aur Ham ne Aap peeche baithkar padhi jab salam phera to farmaya: Imam sirf pairwi ke liye banaya gaya hai; jab woh takbir kahe to takbir kaho, jab woh ruku kare to ruku karo, jab woh kahe: Allah ne us ki suni Jis ne us ki tareef ki, to kaho: Aey Allah, Aey hamare Rabb, Tere liye tareef hai; jab woh sajdah kare to sajdah karo, aur jab woh baithkar namaz padhe to sab baithkar padho"
"2210","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b, Zam'ah aur Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad na karo, bughz na rakho; qata-hijr na karo, peeth na phero; aur Allah ke bando bhai-bhai bano"
"2211","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada chahi kare"
"2212","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Asr padhte the, aur jane wala aavaalii ki taraf jata jabke suraj buland hota tha"
"2213","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare ghar tashreef jane, to Ham ne Aap liye bakri ka doodh dohaa, aur kuen ke pani se karaya gaya aur pyala diya gaya, Abu Aap jabke Bakr baayiin taraf the, aur ek dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki daayiin taraf tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne piya, aur dehati ko bacha diya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Daayen wala, phir daayen chhae"
"2214","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, hazzaaa Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan dogaanaa kahen aur iqamat ekaharii."
"2215","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat par meri ummat mein Abu sab raheem Bakr hain; Allah ke deen mein sab sakht Umar hain; sab haya — ya sab sachche haya — Usman hain — Yunus ko shak hua — halal-haram ke Mu'az bin sab jaanakaara Jabal hain; jo Allah ne mujh par nazil kiya us ke Ubayy bin sab jaanakaara Ka'b hain; Zaid bin wirasat ke sab jaanakaara Sabit hain; aur is Abu Ubaidah ummat ke ameen Jarrah hain"
"2216","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas bin Sireen se: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chataai par namaz padhi"
"2217","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas bin Sireen se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Anas se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Chasht padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap use padhte nahin dekha"
"2218","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek Maheena qunut padhi, usayyaa par badaduaa karte hue"
"2219","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Raziyallahu ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Anas se poocha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khizab kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Us hadd tak na pahunche — aur apne thode safed ka zikr kiya — Abu lekin Bakr ne mehndi-katama se khizab kiya"
"2220","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Jabr ne mujhe khabar di: Anas ko suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ansar ke bare mein farmaya: Ansar mo'min ki nishani aur munafiq ki nishani hain; un se sirf mo'min muhabbat rakhta hai, aur un se sirf munafiq nafrat rakhta hai"
"2221","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Jabr ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) makkuuka se wuzu karte the aur paanch makkuukon se ghusl karte the"
"2222","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Durasta ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Raqashi Aban se, Anas se, marfoo'an Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Suraj-chand aag mein badhiyaa baila hain"
"2223","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera qaum ke sath baithna jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr karte hain, Fajr ki namaz se suraj nikalne tak, mujhe us se zyada mahboob hai jis par suraj nikla; aur mera Allah ka zikr karna Asr ki namaz se suraj doobne tak, mujhe aath Ismaili aazad karne se zyada mahboob hai, mein se har ek ki diyat barah hazaar hai to Ham ne un ki diyaten majlis mein kiya aur chiyaanave hazaar huin aur yahan koi kehta hai: Ismail ki aulaad mein se chaar — Allah ki qasam, Unhon ne sirf kaha: Aath, mein se har ek ki diyat barah hazaar hai"
"2224","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Raqashi Yazid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saal ke chhe din roze se mana kiya; Tashreeq ke teen din, Eid-Fitr ka din, Eid-Azha ka din, aur dinon mein khaas karke Jume ka din"
"2225","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ki azan di jae to aasman ke darwaze khole jate hain aur dua qabool hoti hai Yazid ne kaha: Kaha jata tha: Azan-iqamat ke darmiyan dua radd nahin hoti"
"2226","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko ek din roze ka hukm diya aur koi iftar na kare yahan tak ke main use ijazat dun to logon ne roza rakha; jab Sham hui to aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aane laga aur kehne laga: Main aaj se rozedar raha; mujhe ijazat den aur iftar karun to Aap use ijazat dete aur aadmi aata aur woh kehta aur Aap use ijazat dete yahan tak ke ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tumhare ghar ki do ladkiyan aaj se rozedar thin; unhen ijazat den aur iftar karen to Aap ne us se earaaza kiya phir Us ne Aap se dohraya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Unhon ne roza nahin rakha; Jis ne din logon ka gosht khate guzara, Us ne kaise roza rakha? Jao aur unhen hukm do, agar woh rozedar hon to qai karen to Unhon ne kiya, aur mein se har ek ne jama khoon ki qai ki to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap khabar di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar woh maratiin jabke woh mein hota to aag unhen kha jati"
"2227","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Apni safen seedhi karo, milne khade ho; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main shaitanon ko tumhari safon ke darmiyan dekhta hun goya ghubarailii bakriyan hon"
"2228","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulm teen hain; zulm jise Allah na choregaa, zulm jo muaf hoga, aur zulm jo na muaf hoga raha woh zulm jo na muaf hoga woh shirk hai, Allah use na muaf karega aur raha woh zulm jo muaf hoga woh bande ka apne-Rabb ke darmiyan zulm hai aur raha jo na chhoda jaega woh Allah ka mein se kuch se kuch ka badla hai"
"2229","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jume ke din wuzu kare to usi se — Kya hi achcha; aur jo ghusl kare to ghusl afzal hai"
"2230","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Anas se kaha: Aey Abu Hamzah, mushrikon ke bachchon ke bare mein tumhara Kya kehna hai? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ki koi burayi na thi ke us se saza paen aur aag walon mein se hon; un ki koi acchaaii na thi ke us ka badla paen aur jannat ke badshahon mein se hon; woh jannat ke khadim hain"
"2231","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Durasta ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, Anas se, ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas tha phir mar gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di gayi ke woh mar gaya farmaya: Woh jo abhi hamare paas tha? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Goya gusse mein pakad hai, aur mahrum woh hai jo apni wasiyat se mahrum raha"
"2232","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid aur Sabit bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Raziyallahu Asim se, Sireen ki beti Hafsah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne mujh se kaha: Abu Yahya Amrah kis se mare? Main ne kaha: Taoon se to Anas ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Taoon har Musalman ke liye shahadat hai"
"2233","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Huzali Rib'i bin Abdullah bin Jarud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Abu Hajjaj ne mujhe bayan kiya, mere dada Jarud se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab safar mein hote aur nafl namaz ka irada karte to qible ki taraf munh karke takbir kehte, phir namaz padhte jidhar sawari unhen le jati"
"2234","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gharwalon par raham karte the"
"2235","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere Ali bin dada Hilal ne mujhe bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni beti ki qabr ke kinare baithe dekha jabke woh dafan ho rahi thin; to Main ne Aap aankhon ko aansu bahate dekha, aur Aap ne Abu Talha ko un ki qabr mein utara"
"2236","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har namaz ke liye wuzu karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han"
"2237","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu isaama se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab peete to teen saans lete the, aur farmate the: Woh khushagavaara, nafaabakhsha aur shafaabakhsha hai"
"2238","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'aib bin habahaaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Safiyyah ko aazad kiya, aur un ki aazad ko un ka meher banaya"
"2239","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin hunaaii Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ghar ek bartan se ghusl karte the"
"2240","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Asma se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Labbaik umrah-Hajj ikatthe ke sath"
"2241","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu khuraasaanii Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka samne mera zikr ho woh mujh par salat padhe; aur Jis ne mujh par ek martaba salat padha, Allah us par das martaba salat parhegaa."
"2242","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Maslamah Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jootiyon mein namaz padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han"
"2243","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd bin Rahman bin Uqaili budaila ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ke logon mein se khaas log hain kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, woh kaun hain? Farmaya: Quran wale; woh Allah wale aur un ke khaas hain"
"2244","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu qutabii ala se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sardi mein hamen Zuhr padhate the; hamen nahin ma'loom hota tha din kitna guzra zyada hai ya kitna baqi hai"
"2245","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, alavii saalma se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kisi ko munh par kuch na kehte the; ek din ek aadmi Aap paas aaya jis par aap tha to farmaya: Kaash tum Ise hukm dete ke apne se yeh aap dho kare"
"2246","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Khaibar mein dakhil hona chahte the to farmaya: Allah sab bada, Khaibar viiraana hui; Allah sab bada, Khaibar fath hui; jab ham kisi qaum ke aangana utarte to daraaii hui ki subah buri hoti hai"
"2247","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid ne mujhe khabar di: Anas ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne guthli bhar sone par nikah kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waleema karo, chahe bakri se"
"2248","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare ek ladke ko bulaya aur Us ne Aap pachhna lagaya; aur us ke liye ek sa' ya do sa', ya ek mudd ya do mudd ka hukm diya to us mein baat ki gayi, aur us ke mehnatane mein kam kiya gaya"
"2249","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd ala bin huraqaa ke aazad-karda Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Umar Anas bin Sabit ke paas dakhil hue, jabke Ham ne Khalid bin Usaid ke sath Zuhr padhi thi to unhon ne kaha: Kya Tum ne Asr padhi? Ham ne kaha: Nahin, lekin Ham ne Khalid ke sath Zuhr padhi to unhon ne kaha: Khade ho, Asr padho; kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh munafiq ki namaz hai; use suraj doobne ke qareeb padhta hai, us mein Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr sirf thoda karta hai use deta hai yahan tak ke jab suraj doobne par ho to khada kar padhta hai, us mein Allah ka zikr sirf thoda karta hai"
"2250","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor aur A'mash se, Salim bin Abu Ja'd se, Anas se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, qayamat kab hai? Farmaya: Tum ne us ke liye Kya tayyar ki? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne us ke liye zyada namaz-roza-Sadqa tayyar nahin kiya, siwae is ke ke main Allah-Rasulullah se muhabbat rakhta hun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum usi ke sath ho jis se Tum ne muhabbat ki"
"2251","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Rib'i bin Hirash ko suna, Abu abyaza se, Anas se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Asr padhte the jabke suraj safed buland hota tha"
"2252","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam Quraish mein se hain; jab faisla karen to insaf karen, jab wa'da karen to poora karen, jab raham manga jae to raham karen jo mein se aisa na kare, us par Allah, farishton aur sab logon ki lanat hai; un se na nafl qabool hoga na farza."
"2253","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Abu Maimunah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) pakhane aate the; to main aur Ansar ka ek chhota ladka pani ki mashkiizaa lekar Aap peeche chalte the, aur Aap us se istinja karte the"
"2254","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera hauz itne se itne tak hai; us mein bartan sitare ki ginti mein hain, mushk se zyada khushbudar, shehed se miithe, barf se thande, doodh se safed hain Jis ne us mein se ek ghoont piya, woh kabhi pyasa na hoga; aur Jis ne us mein se na piya, woh kabhi seraaba na hoga"
"2255","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Anas ke aazad-karda Sadqa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se namaz ke waqton ke bare mein poocha, to kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr padhte the jab suraj dhalta tha, Asr tumhari in do namazon ke darmiyan, Maghrib jab suraj duubataa tha, Isha jab shafaq duubataa tha, aur Fajr tulu' se nazar phailane tak"
"2256","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Habib ne ham se bayan kiya — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Anas ke sahaba mein se un se zyada siqah se nahin mile; un se Hammad bin Zaid aur Hammad bin Salamah ne riwayat ki, aur Shu'bah un ke paas aate the — unhon ne kaha: Anas ko kehte suna, marfoo'an: Aag se log hain, jal cukane ke baad, aur jannat mein dakhil honge"
"2257","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rahman bin Wardan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham Anas ke paas dakhil hue aur un se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Asr kab padhte the? To kaha: Use padhte the jabke suraj safed-saaf hota tha"
"2258","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin hain Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin Abd bin Taimi Rahman se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen Juma padhate the jab suraj dhalta tha"
"2259","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid se, Anas ya Hasan se — Abu Dawud ko shak hua — ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni us beemari mein jis mein Aap wafat hui, Usamah bin Zaid ka sahara lekar nikle, aur logon ko ek kapde mein namaz padhai; qitrii kapde mein, jis ke donon ko ulte kiye the"
"2260","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far bin Sulaiman aur Sadqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Hamen nakhun katne, zer-istidad mundne, thaile ke baal ukhaarane aur moonchh kaati mein chalis din muqarrar kiye gaye"
"2261","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu madaainii Imran se, Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: Aap aath se panah mangte the: Fikr, ghum, aazizii, susti, buzdili, bukhl, qarz ke bojh aur logon ke ghalbe se"
"2262","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' bin Subaih ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Ubadah bin Samit aur Anas bin Malik se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chandi chandi se, Sona sone se, khajoor khajoor se, gehn gehn se, jau jau se, namak namak se, barabar-barabar — ya kaha: Wazan-vazana. unhon ne kaha: Mein se ek ne kaha, doosre ne na kaha: Dinar ko chandi se ek ke badle do mein koi harj nahin, naqd; gehn ko jau se ek ke badle do mein koi harj nahin; namak ko jau se ek ke badle do mein koi harj nahin, samajhte"
"2263","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Fazarah ko suna, Anas se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Ham do rak'aten padhte the — ya'ni Maghrib se pahle — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein"
"2264","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin shumaita ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hanafi Bakr ko suna, apne walid-chacha ko bayan karte hue, Anas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mangna sirf teen mein se ek ke liye halal hai; sakht qarz, todne wali ghariibii, ya dukhadaayii khuuna."
"2265","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin shumaita ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid-chacha ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Bakr se, Anas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne niilaama mein chadar-pyala becha aur farmaya: Kaun khareede? To ek aadmi ne kaha: Ek dirham mein to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun kaha badhae?."
"2266","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Huzali Rib'i bin Abdullah bin Jarud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Jarud ne bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri walida Sulaim ki walida ke paas dakhil hote the aur woh Aap kuch hadiya deti thin ek din hamare paas dakhil hue jabke un ke paas mera chhota bhai tha; to use dil bujha dekha to farmaya: Tumhare bete ko Kya hai, Aey Sulaim ki walida? To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ki chhoti chidiya mar gayi jis se woh khelta tha to farmaya: Aey Umair ke baap, nughaira mar gayi, us par zamana aaya"
"2267","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim bin avara Abdullah ne mujhe bayan kiya: Anas ko suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gadhe par sawar hote the, oon pehente the, ghulam ki dawat qabool karte the; aur Main ne Aap Khaibar ke din gadhe par dekha jis ki chara chhaal ki thi"
"2268","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu ghalib ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko dekha, ek aadmi par namaz padhi aur takht ke sirhane khade hue; phir Quraish ki ek aurat laya gayi aur us par namaz padhi, aur takht ke darmiyan ke qareeb khade hue un ke janaze mein hazir logon mein Adawi Ziyad ke bete ala the jab Unhon ne khade hone ka farq dekha to ham ne kaha: Aey Abu Hamzah, Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aurat-mard se aise khade hote the jaise tum khade hue? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur kaha: Yaad rakho"
"2269","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Bakr ki wafat ke baad Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha: Apna hath karo, main tum us par bai'at karun jis par tum pahle tumhare donon sahaba se ki thi — ya'ni: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr se to un se sunne-maanane par bai'at ki, jitna kar Aap"
"2270","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu nazraa ko suna, Abu Khudri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Logon ka dar — ya: Logon ka rob, Shu'bah ne donon mein se ek kaha — tum se kisi ko jana haq baat kehne se na roke. aur muamla bhulaayaa jata raha yahan tak ke Ham ne us ki"
"2271","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab safar mein teen hon to mein se ek un ki imamat kare; aur imamat ka sab haqdar mein sab achcha qari hai"
"2272","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bashir Uqbah akiila ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazraa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, ke ek dehati ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main goh wale bagh mein hun, aur woh mere gharwalon ki aam khuraaka hai? To Aap us se khamosh rahe to ham ne kaha: Dobara poocho to Us ne dobara poocha aur Aap khamosh rahe phir ham ne kaha: Dobara poocho to Us ne teesri martaba dobara poocha to farmaya: Aey dehati, Allah Azza-wa Jall gai-Isra'il ke do qabilon se ghazabanaaka hua aur unhen zameen mein chalne wale janwar bana masakha kiya; main nahin janta shayad woh mein se hon; main na tumhen un se mana karta hun, na tumhen un ka hukm deta hun"
"2273","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sa'di nuaamaa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni jootiyon mein namaz padhi, aur logon ne apni jootiyon mein namaz padhi phir Aap ne apni jootiyan utaariin, aur logon ne namaz mein apni jootiyan utaariin. jab Aap namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: Tumhen namaz mein apni jootiyan utarne par Kis ne ubhara? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Ham ne Aap karte dekha aur Ham ne kiya farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe khabar di ke mein gandagi hai; jab tum se ek masjid aae to dekhe; agar apni jootiyon mein gandagi dekhe, warna mein namaz padhe"
"2274","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Tarif bin Sufyan se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the, aur ek talab par aae jis mein murdaara tha to kuch logon ne wuzu kiya, aur kuch log ruke yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aayein to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ke peeche aae aur farmaya: Wuzu karo aur piyo; kyunke pani ko koi cheez napak nahin karti"
"2275","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Asr ke baad suraj doobne tak khutba diya; jise yaad raha yaad raha, jise bhool gaya bhool gaya to farmaya: Khabardar, duniya sarasabza miithii hai; Allah tumhen us mein khalifa karta hai aur dekhta hai tum kaise karte ho Khabardar, duniya se bacho, aurton se bacho Khabardar, Adam ke bete alag-alag tabaqon par paida kiye gae; mein se koi mo'min paida hota hai, mo'min halak hai, mo'min marta hai; mein se koi kafir paida hota hai, kafir halak hai, kafir marta hai; mein se koi kafir paida hota hai, kafir halak hai, mo'min marta hai; mein se koi mo'min paida hota hai, mo'min halak hai, kafir marta hai Khabardar, sab husn tajir woh hain jo adayegi-taqaaze mein husn hon Khabardar, sab bure tajir woh hain jo adayegi-taqaaze mein bure hon agar woh adayegi mein achcha aur taqaaze mein bura ho, ya taqaaze mein achcha aur adayegi mein bura ho, to woh us se us se hai Khabardar, sab bure mard woh hain jo gusse mein tez aur laut mein peeth hon Khabardar, sab husn mard woh hain jo gusse mein peeth aur laut mein tez hon agar woh gusse mein tez aur laut mein tez ho to woh us se us se hai; aur agar woh gusse mein peeth aur laut mein peeth ho to woh us se us se hai Khabardar, gussa angare hai jo Adam ke bete ke pet mein jalaya jata hai; Kya Tum ne us ki aankh ki surkhi aur us ki ragon ka phuulanaa nahin dekha? Jab aisa ho to zameen pakad, zameen pakaro. Khabardar, har Dhokebaz ke liye us ke dhoke ke barabar jhanda hoga Hasan ne kaha: Us ke peeche nasba kiya jayega phir Abu Khudri ki hadees ki taraf aae, phir kaha: Khabardar, aam ke ameer se bada Dhokebaz koi nahin Khabardar, logon ka rob kisi aadmi ko jana haq kehne se na roke. Khabardar, duniya mein se jo guzar us mein Wahy baqi hai jo aaj ke din mein se jo guzra us mein baqi hai"
"2276","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hunain ki taraf nikle, Ramazan ki attharah raaten guzarne par; to logon ke grohon ne roza rakha aur doosron ne iftar kiya to rozedar ko us ke roze par aib na lagaya — ya kaha: Na rozedar ko us ke roze par aib lagaya, na iftar karne wale ko us ke iftar par"
"2277","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mustamira bin rayyaana ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne khutbe mein farmaya: Khabardar, logon ka dar kisi aadmi ko jana haq kehne se na roke."
"2278","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mustamira ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazraa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Dhokebaz ke liye qayamat ke din jhanda hoga"
"2279","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mustamira ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab umadaa khushbu mushk hai"
"2280","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke unhen bhook lagi — ya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi ko bhook lagi — to un ke gharwalon mein se kisi ne un se kaha: kaash tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jate aur woh tumhen madad dete to woh chale aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete pae, jabke Aap farma rahe the: Jo ghani banegaa Allah use ghani karega; jo daman banegaa Allah use pak rakhega; aur Jis ne ham se manga aur Ham ne kuch paya to use dete unhon ne kaha: To woh wapas aur Aap se na manga, na us ke baad kisi se manga"
"2281","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu ashahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba mein rehna dekha, to farmaya: Meri pairwi karo, aur tumhare baad wale tumhari pairwi karen; log picharate rahenge yahan tak ke Allah unhen peeche karega"
"2282","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aban bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fajr se pahle witr padho"
"2283","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Ash'ari ne Umar se ijazat mangi aur Unhon ne ijazat na di; to woh aur to Unhon ne un ki taraf bheja: Tumhen Kis ne diya? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne teen martaba ijazat mangi aur mujhe ijazat na mili; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab ijazat mangne wala teen martaba ijazat mange aur use ijazat na mile to wapas jae to unhon ne kaha: Tum mere paas use zaroor laoge jo yeh jane, warna tumhare sath aisa-aisa karunga to Abu Khudri ne kaha: Ash'ari kaanpate hue mere paas aae, un ka chehra zard tha to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ke gole par khade hue aur kaha: Main Allah ki qasam deta hun, jo is bare mein kuch jane woh khada kar gawahi de; mujhe is aadmi se apne nafs ka dar hai Abu Khudri ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main tumhare sath hun doosre ne kaha: Main tumhare sath hun to un se bojh gaya"
"2284","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazraa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke do grohon ke darmiyan phoot hogi; un ke darmiyan tuutane wala tuutegaa, aur donon grohon mein se haq ke qareeb wala use qatl karega"
"2285","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use talash karo jab saat raaten baqi hon, ya paanch raaten baqi hon, ya teen raaten baqi hon"
"2286","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Jurairi se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shab-Qadr caubiisaviin raat hai"
"2287","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab Khandaq khodii to log ek-ek iinta uthate the, jabke Ammar ko koi takleef thi; to woh do-do eentein uthane lage Abu Khudri ne kaha: Mere sahaba ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke sar se mitti jhadte the aur farmate the: Afsos tum par, sumayyaa ke bete; tumhein baghi giroh qatl karega"
"2288","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, khulaida bin Ja'far se, Abu nazraa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab umadaa khushbu mushk hai"
"2289","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' bin Subaih ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nazraa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khudri ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Sood ke bare mein tumhare fatave ka Kya khayal hai; Kya woh cheez hai jo tum apni rae se kehte ho, ya woh cheez hai jo Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main us mein koi harj nahin dekhta jab woh naqd ho to Abu Khudri ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko suna, jabke Aap paas us khajoor se achchi khajoor laya gayi jo Aap paas laya jati thi to farmaya: Yeh kahan se hai? To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main falan ke ghar gaya aur unhen do sa' diye aur ek sa' liya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ka sa' unhen laotao, aur hamare do sa' aao phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se, chandi chandi se, khajoor khajoor se, gehn gehn se, jau jau se, namak namak se, barabar-barabar — ya kaha: Barabar jaisi — jo zyada de ya zyada le, Us ne sood khaya"
"2290","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin Nadabi Harb ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lahasuna-pyaaza-gandane se mana kiya ham ne kaha: Aey Abu Sa'id, Kya woh haram hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin"
"2291","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe, banane, khajoor ke thuuntha aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya ham ne kaha: Aey Abu Sa'id, Kya woh haram hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se mana kiya"
"2292","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne musalsal roze se mana kiya; meri yeh bahan musalsal roza rakhti hai aur main use mana karta hun"
"2293","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin Harb ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Arafat mein dua mangi; apne hath aise kiye; un ki peeth aasman ki taraf aur hatheliyon zameen ki taraf kiya"
"2294","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Abu vaddaaka ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Jab hamen Khaibar ke qaidi mile to Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se azl ke bare mein poocha to farmaya: Har pani se bachcha nahin hota; jab Allah Azza-wa Jall kuch paida karna chahe to use koi cheez nahin rokti"
"2295","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Tayyah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu vaddaaka ko kehte suna: Main tumbe mein na piuungaa, Abu jabase Khudri ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas madahosha laya gaya to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne sharab nahin pi; Main ne tumbe se pi hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke bare mein hukm diya aur use jootiyon se marna gaya, hathon se dhakelaa gaya; aur mana kiya ke tumbe mein nabeez banai jae"
"2296","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas bin Sireen ne mujhe khabar di, Ma'bad bin Sireen se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se azl ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Tum par koi harj nahin ke na karo; woh to taqdeer hai"
"2297","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Aslam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum pichhle ke tariiqon par caloge, yahan tak ke agar woh goh ke bil mein dakhil hon to tum us mein dakhil hoge to kaha gaya: Woh kaun hain? Farmaya: Yahood-nasaaraa."
"2298","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Zubai Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Umar bin Khattab ke aazad-karda Aslam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Sa'id Khudri se, ke logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham qayamat ke din apne Rabb ko dekhenge? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum dopehar ke suraj ko saaf dekhte hue jis mein badal na hon, nuqsan uthate ho — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni Kya tum shak karte ho — unhon ne kaha: Nahin farmaya: Kya tum chaudveen raat ke chand ko saaf raat mein jis mein badal na hon, nuqsan uthate ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Tum qayamat ke din Allah Azza-wa Jall ko dekhne mein utna hi nuqsan uthao jitna mein se ek ko dekhne mein uthate ho jab qayamat ka din hoga to pukaarne wala pukaarega: Har ummat us ke peeche chali jise woh puujatii thi aur koi na bacegaa jo Allah ke siwa buton-paanson ko puujataa tha, magar aag mein girenge. yahan tak ke jab Wahy bacenge jo Allah ko puujate the, nek ya badkar, aur kitaabiyon ke bachte to kaha jaega: Tum Kya puujate the? To kahenge: Ham uzaira bin Allah ko puujate the to kaha jaega: Tum ne jhoot kaha; Allah Azza-wa Jall ne na biwi pakdi na beta to Kya chahte ho? To kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb, ham pyase hue, hamen pilaie to un ki taraf ishara kiya jaega: Kya tum ghaata nahin aate? To un ke liye jahannam uthai jaegi goya saraaba ho, ek-doosre ko todti hui; yahan tak ke aag mein girenge. phir Eisaiyon ko bulaya jaega aur un se kaha jaega: Tum Kya puujate the? To kahenge: Ham Masih bin Allah ko puujate the to kaha jaega: Tum ne jhoot kaha; Allah ne na biwi pakdi na beta to Kya chahte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Aey hamare Rabb, ham pyase hue, hamen pilaie to un ki taraf ishara kiya jaega: Kya tum ghaata nahin aate? Aur un ke liye jahannam uthai jaegi goya saraaba ho, ek-doosre ko todti hui; yahan tak ke aag mein girenge. yahan tak ke jab Wahy bacenge jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ko puujate the, nek ya badkar, to un ke paas Rabbul-Aalameen aayega aur farmata: Mard intezar karte ho? Har ummat us ke peeche chali jise woh puujatii thi to kahenge: Ham duniya mein logon se alag hue aur un ka sath na diya; ham apne Rabb ka intezar karte hain jis ki ham ibadat karte the to farmata: Kya tumhare-Rabb ke darmiyan koi nishani hai jis se tum use pahchante ho? To kahenge: Ji Han to pindli khole jayegi duniya mein khushi se Allah ko sajdah karne wala koi na bacegaa magar use sajde ki ijazat di jaegi; aur dikhaave-muqabla se sajdah karne wala koi na bacegaa magar us ki peeth ek takhtaa hogi; jab bhi woh sajdah jawab, citta giregaa. unhon ne kaha: Phir woh apne sar uthaaenge aur woh farmata: Main tumhara Rabb hun to kahenge: Tum hamare Rabb ho to pul rakha jaega aur sifarish halal hogi aur kehta: Aey Rabb, salamti-salaamatii. to mo'min pul par hain to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, pul Kya hai? Farmaya: Phisalane wala, phisalaane wala; us mein kaante, kunde aur capataa kaanta hai, jis mein tedha kaanta hai, jise saadaana kaha jata hai mo'min calenge palaka jhapakne jaise, bijli jaise, hawa jaise, umadaa ghode-Sawariyon jaisa to nijaat paane wala samet, kharoch khaya chhoda gaya, aur aundhaa aag mein jab mo'min aag se chutakaaraa payenge to, us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum mujh se haq mein jhagarane mein momineen se zyada sakht na hoge, jo Allah Azza-wa Jall se apne aag wale bhaiyon ke bare mein jhagarenge. to kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb, hamare bhai jo hamare sath namaz padhte the, hamare sath roza rakhte the, hamare sath Hajj karte the to farmata: Jao, jis ka chehra pahchana use nikalo aur un ki tasweeren aag par haram ki jaaengii. to woh jaenge aur unhen nikaalenge; aag ne aadmi ko takhnon tak pakda hoga, aadhi pindliyon tak to bahut makhlooq nikaalenge. phir aur aur kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb, Ham ne aag mein kisi ko nahin chhoda jin ke nikaalane ka Tu ne hamen hukm diya tha to farmata: Jao, jis ke dil mein dinar bhar bhalai pao use nikalo unhon ne kaha: To woh jaenge aur bahut makhlooq nikaalenge. phir aur aur kahenge: Ham ne aag mein kisi ko nahin chhoda jin ke nikaalane ka Tu ne hamen hukm diya tha to farmata: Jao, jis ke dil mein aadha misqaala bhalai pao use nikalo to woh aur aur bahut makhlooq nikaalenge. phir aur aur kahenge: Ham ne aag mein kisi ko nahin chhoda jin ke nikaalane ka Tu ne hamen hukm diya tha, magar nikal laye to farmata: Jao, jis ke dil mein raaii bhar bhalai pao use nikalo to woh jaenge aur bahut makhlooq nikaalenge. phir aur aur kahenge: Ham ne aag mein kisi ko nahin chhoda jin ke nikaalane ka Tu ne hamen hukm diya tha, magar nikal jane — Abu Sa'id Khudri kehte the: Agar tum is hadees ki sach na karo to yeh aayat padho: {Beshak Allah raaii bhar zulm nahin karta} aayat to Allah Azza-wa Jall farmata: Farishton ne sifarish ki, ambiya ne sifarish ki, momineen ne sifarish ki, aur sab raham wala hi bacha unhon ne kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall aag se mutthi bharegaa aur us mein se aisi qaum nikaalegaa jinhon kabhi koi bhalai na ki thi; woh koyalaa ho chuke honge to woh jannat ke munh ki nahar mein phenke jaenge, jise aabe-hayaata kaha jata hai to apne sare se hain jaise biija sailab ke kuda se nikalta hai; Kya Tum ne use darakht-pathar ki taraf hara-zard nahin dekha, aur jo us mein se chhaon mein ho safed hota hai? — Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, goya tum dehat caraate the! — To woh moti jaise hain, un ki gardanon mein mohar hogi to kaha jaega: Yeh Allah ke aazad-karda hain, jo aag se nikale gae baghair amal ke jo Unhon ne kiya, na baghair neki ke jo Unhon ne aage bheji to kaha jaega: Jannat mein dakhil ho; jo kuch Tum ne dekha woh tumhara hai to kahenge: Aey hamare Rabb, Tu ne hamen diya jo Tu ne jahanon mein se kisi ko na diya to farmata: Mere paas tumhare liye is se afzal hai? To kahenge: Aey Rabb, is se afzal Kya hai? To farmata: Meri razaamandii; is ke baad tum kabhi ghadabnak na karunga"
"2299","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Hilal bin Abu Maimunah se, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar par baithe aur ham gird baithe to farmaya: Mujhe tumhare bare mein apne baad dar hai jo tum par duniya ki raunaqa-khubsurat se khola jayega to ek aadmi ne kaha: Kya bhalai burayi aati hai? To khamosh rahe to un se kaha gaya: Tumhen Kya hai, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se baat karte ho aur woh tumhen jawab nahin dete? Aur Ham ne dekha un par nazil ho raha hai to jage aur apne se pasiinaa ponchaa. to farmaya: Poochne wala kahan hai? Goya un ki tareef ki to farmaya: Bhalai burayi nahin laatii. bahaara jo ugaatii hai us mein se koi pet phuulakara marte hai ya qareeb marta hai, siwae hara bachna khane wale ke; Us ne khaya yahan tak ke jab us ki donon kokhen bhariin, phir suraj ki taraf munh kiya, hajat-peshab kiya, jugaalii ki yeh maal sarasabza meetha hai; Musalman ka maal Kya hi achcha hai, us ke liye jo us mein se miskeen-yateem-musafir ko de — ya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — jise woh haq leta hai woh us ke jaisa hai jo khata hai aur sera nahin hota; aur qayamat ke din us par gawah hoga"
"2300","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Khudri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Sona sone se na becho siwae barabar-barabar, aur chandi chandi se na becho siwae barabar-barabar"
"2301","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansar se bughz na rakhega woh mard jo Allah-aakhirat par iman rakhta hai"
"2302","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ko bura na do; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum se ek Uhud bhar Sona kharch kare to mein se ek ke mudd ko na paega, na us ke aadhe ko"
"2303","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek janaza dekhe to khada ho; jo us ke peeche chale woh na baithe yahan tak ke woh rakha jae"
"2304","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Abu Salih Zakwan se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ansar ke ek aadmi ke paas se guzre aur un ki taraf bheja to woh nikle jabke un ka sar pani tapakaataa tha to farmaya: Shayad Ham ne tumhen jaldi di unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan, Aey Allah ke farmaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab jaldi di jae ya qahat ho to tum par ghusl nahin, aur tum par wuzu hai"
"2305","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abu Salih se, Safwan se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe, Allah us ka chehra jahannam se sattar saal door karega"
"2306","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Quraish ke giroh mein shab-Qadr ka zikr kiya, aur main Abu Khudri ke paas aaya, jo mere dost the to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum hamare sath bagh ki taraf na nikaloge? To ham nikle jabke un par un ki khamiisaa thi to main ne kaha: Mujhe shab-Qadr ki khabar den; Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko shab-Qadr ka zikr karte suna? To unhon ne kaha: Ji Han Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ramazan ke aakhri ashrah mein e'tikaf kiya to hamen biisaviin subah khutba diya aur farmaya: Mujhe shab-Qadr dikhai gayi, lekin mujhe bhulaa di gayi — ya bhool gaya — to use aakhri ashrah mein taaq raaton mein talash karo jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath e'tikaf mein tha woh aur aur Main ne dekha goya main pani-keechad mein sajdah kar raha hun unhon ne kaha: To ham aae aur aasman mein badal ka tukda na dekhte the aur gira aai aur ham par baarish hui yahan tak ke masjid ki chhat bahii, woh khajoor ki dal ki thi aur namaz khadi hui, aur Main ne Aap pani-keechad mein sajdah karte dekha, yahan tak ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki peshani mein mitti dekhi — ya kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki peshani mein mitti ka nishaana."
"2307","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Salamah Us ne khabar di Jis ne Rahman Abd ko dekha, jabke un ke paas thariida-laundaa laya gaya to makkhi aai aur us mein girii. to Abu Salamah ne use pakda aur us mein duboyaa. to main ne kaha: Yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Abu Khudri ne mujhe bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek ke bartan ya mashroob mein makkhi gire to use us mein duboe; kyunke us ke ek par mein zehr — ya beemari — hai, doosre mein shifa hai; woh shifa karta hai aur beemari rakhta hai"
"2308","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein jama khajoor rizq mein milti thin; to ham do sa' ke badle ek sa' dete the to yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchi, aur farmaya: Khabardar, do sa' khajoor ek sa' ke badle nahin, do sa' gehn ek sa' ke badle nahin, do dirham ek dirham ke badle nahin"
"2309","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to khade ho; jo us ke peeche chale woh na baithe yahan tak ke woh rakha jae"
"2310","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin mihazama ne ham se bayan kiya: Abdi Umarah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Khudri ke paas aate the; jab hamen dekhte to kehte: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wasiyat se khushaaamadiida. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Qaum pahunchegi jo ilm maangegii; jab unhen dekho to un se achcha sulook karo"
"2311","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Umarah se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Fajr pae aur witr na padha ho, us ka koi witr nahin"
"2312","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdi Umarah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas azl ka zikr hua, to farmaya: Agar Allah Azza-wa Jall kisi cheez ka faisla kare to woh zaroor hogi, chahe woh alag ho Abu Khudri ne kaha: Main ne apni laundi se alag hua aur Us ne sab pyare logon ko janmaa; yeh larakaa."
"2313","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, mukaatiba Firas se, aufii Atiyyah se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal ke liye Sadqa halal hai jab woh Allah Azza-wa Jall ki raah mein ho"
"2314","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, Atiyyah se, Abu Khudri se, ke do muhallon ke darmiyan maqtool paya gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke naapaa jae, donon mein se kis zyada qareeb hai to woh donon mein se ek ke balisht bhar qareeb paya gaya Abu Khudri ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki balisht dekh raha hun — to us ki diyat un par daali"
"2315","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin Muslim ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Tariq bin Shihab ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ne khutba namaz se pahle kiya, to ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Tum ne sunnat ki mukhalifat ki; khutba namaz ke baad tha unhon ne kaha: Woh chhoda gaya, Aey Abu falan — Shu'bah ne kaha: Woh ghalat padhta tha — to Abu khade Khudri hue aur kaha: Yeh bolne wala kaun hai? Us ne apna farz ada kiya; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Tum se jo burayi dekhe, use hath se roke; jo na kar sake, use zuban se roke; jo na kar sake, use dil se roke; aur woh kamzor iman hai"
"2316","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Ansari Yahya se, apne walid se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch avaaqii se kam mein Sadqa nahin, paanch wasq se kam mein Sadqa nahin, paanch oonton se kam mein Sadqa nahin"
"2317","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Abdi Raziyallahu se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz se salam pherte to teen martaba kehte the: Tumhare Rabb ki paki, izzat wale Rabb ki, us se jo woh bayan karte hain; Rasoolon par salam; aur sab tareef Allah ke liye, jo jahanon ka Rabb hai"
"2318","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Buza'ah ka kunwan, jis mein haiz ke kapde-murdaara phenke jate hain? Farmaya: Pani ko koi cheez napak nahin karti"
"2319","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, ammii Zaid se, Abu naajii Siddiq se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein bachchon wali qaidiyan bechte the"
"2320","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Ubaid bin Sabbaq se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein bhaari beemar hota aur us ki hazri hoti to ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bulaye the yahan tak ke Aap us ke paas hote kabhi woh lamba hota, to ham kehte the: Yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par bhaari hai; Ham ne samjha unhen marne tak karen, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ki taraf bulaaen. to ham us par the phir Ham ne samjha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye Narmi hai ke ham apne janaze un ki taraf uthaye laye to Ham ne kiya, aur yahi kartin raha"
"2321","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Abu Hisham se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ammar ke bare mein farmaya: Tumhein baghi giroh qatl karega"
"2322","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Zurqi Ibrahim bin Ubaid bin Rifa'ah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne khana banaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)-sahaba ko dawat di to ek aadmi ne kaha: Main rozedar hun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare bhai ne khana banaya aur tumhen bulaya; iftar karo aur us ki jagah ek din ki qaza karo"
"2323","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mahri ke aazad-karda Sa'id ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hudhail mein se Bani lihayaana ki taraf lashkar bheja aur farmaya: Har do aadmiyon mein se ek nikle, aur sawab donon ke darmiyan hai"
"2324","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di: Abu Bakhtari ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh nazil hui: {Jab Allah ki madad-fath aae} to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use padha yahan tak ke khatma kiya, phir farmaya: Main-sahaba ek taraf hain, log ek taraf hain; fath ke baad hijrat nahin Abu Khudri ne kaha: Main ne yeh Marwan bin hadees Hakam ko bayan ki, jo Madinah ke ameer the to unhon ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot farmaya un ke paas Zaid bin Sabit aur Rafi' bin Khadij the, aur woh un ke sath takht par the to Abu Khudri ne kaha: Yeh donon agar chahen to tumhen bayan karen, lekin yeh darta hai ke tum us se us ki qaum ki saradaarii chheen loge, aur yeh darta hai ke tum us se Sadqa chheen loge — ya'ni Sabit ke bete zaida. unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne un par chhadi uthai; jab Unhon ne yeh dekha to kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha"
"2325","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu Bakhtari se, ek aadmi se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se koi apne ko haqeer na samjhe ke Allah ki koi baat dekhe jis mein us ka kehna ho, aur use na kahe to Allah Azza-wa Jall se liye, jabke Us ne use zaya kiya hoga to farmata: Tumhen Kya roka? To kehta: Logon se daraa. to farmata: Mujh se daranaa zyada laeq tha"
"2326","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se azl ke bare mein poocha gaya, to farmaya: Tum par koi harj nahin ke na karo; woh to taqdeer hai"
"2327","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sadqa bin Musa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik bin dinar ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abdullah bin haddaanii ghalib se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do khaslatein mo'min mein jama nahin hoti; bukhl aur badaakhalaaqii."
"2328","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Sahba se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Abu Khudri se — Hammad ne kaha: Main use marfu' hi janta hun — farmaya: Aazaa zuban ka kaffara dete hain, kehte hain: Hamare bare mein Allah se daro; agar tum seedhe rahe to ham seedhe rahenge, aur agar tum terhe hue to ham terhe honge"
"2329","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Abd ala bin Rahman bin Raziyallahu se, huraqaa ke aazad-karda, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se kaha: mujhe tum hajat hai; Main ne samjha woh duniya ke saaman mein se kuch chahte hain to main ne kaha: Aey abba, jo chaho mango unhon ne kaha: Main tum mangta hun ke Jume jaldi aao; kyunke Main ne Abu Khudri ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishte Jume ke din logon ko likhte hain; goya oont dene wala, goya gae pesh karne wala, goya bakri pesh karne wala, goya parinda pesh karne wala, goya anda pesh karne chhae jab imam mimbar par baithe to saheefe samete jate hain"
"2330","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hamzah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hilal bin hisna ko kehte suna: Main Madinah aaya aur Abu Khudri ke paas un ke ghar utar to majlis ne mujhe-unhen jama kiya, aur Main ne unhen bayan karte suna unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein bhook lagi yahan tak ke Main ne apne pet par pathar bandha to meri biwi ne mujh se kaha: kaash tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jate aur un se mangte; falan Aap paas aae aur Aap se manga aur Aap ne diya, falan Aap paas aae aur Aap se manga aur Aap ne diya to main ne kaha: Main un se na maanguungaa yahan tak ke kuch na paauun. to talaashaa aur kuch na mila to un ki taraf chala aur Aap khutba dete paya to Aap baat mein se paya: Jo daman banegaa Allah use pak rakhega; jo ghani banegaa Allah use ghani karega; jo ham se lo to ham use denge ya dilaasaa denge; aur jo ham se ghani raha woh hamen us se pasandeeda hai Jis ne ham se manga to main wapas aur us ke baad kisi se kuch na manga phir duniya aai, aur Ansar mein se koi gharavaalaa ham se zyada maal wala na tha"
"2331","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd bin Hakam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Siddiq ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ke andhere mein masajid ki taraf chalne walon ko qayamat ke din mutawajjuh Noor ki khushkhabri do"
"2332","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, hayavaa bin Shami Shuraih se, ek aadmi se jis ka naam liya, Abu Khudri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Tumhara khana sirf muttaqi khae; aur sirf mo'min ki sathi bano"
"2333","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Yazid se, Zuhri se, Ata bin Laisi Yazid se, Abu Khudri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab tum pukaarne wale ko namaz ki azan dete suno to jaisa woh kahe waisa kaho"
"2334","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Abu muttavakkila ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek doharaanaa chahe to wuzu kare"
"2335","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr munkadira ne mujhe khabar di, Amr bin Zurqi Sulaim se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jume ke din ghusl wajib hai, khushbu lagana aur miswak rokna raha ghusl, main gawahi deta hun woh wajib hai; rahe miswak-khushbu, Allah jane wajib hain ya nahin, lekin aisa hi farmaya"
"2336","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, sarraaja Dawud se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne duniya mein resham pahna, woh aakhirat mein na pahanegaa; agar jannat mein dakhil hua to jannatiyon pahanenge, woh na pahanegaa."
"2337","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas rayyaana khajoor laya gayi, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khajoor baala thi — ya'ni us mein khushkii hai to apne khadim se farmaya: Tumhen yeh kahan se mili? Unhon ne kaha: Ham ne apni khajoor ke do sa' is ek sa' ke badle beche to farmaya: Aisa na karo; apni khajoor becho, phir is se apni hajat khariido."
"2338","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein sab bura chor woh hai jo apni namaz curaae. unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh apni namaz kaise karta hai? Farmaya: Us ka ruku-sajdah poora nahin karta"
"2339","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Sa'id bin Musanna ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu muttavakkila se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lakdi, naqeer aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya"
"2340","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin akiila se, Hamzah bin Abu Sa'id se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur farmaya: Khabardar, kuch logon ka Kya hai jo kehte hain meri rishtedari nafa na degii. meri jaan ki qasam, meri nas duniya-aakhirat mein jurii hai Khabardar, main tum hauz par pesh hun, Aey logo. Khabardar, qayamat ke din qaum pahunchegi, aur mein se kehne wala kehta: Ya Rasulullah, main falan bin falan hun to kahunga: Raha nasab, Main ne pahchana; lekin tum mere baad murtada hue aur ulte pair aur"
"2341","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Utbah ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) pahunchne mein kunwari se zyada haya the; jab koi cheez napasand karte to ham use chehre mein pahchante the"
"2342","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Sulaiman bin Abu Sulaiman ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hakim honge jo zulm-jhoot karenge; un ke paas logon mein se khushaamadii aayenge — Imran ne kaha: Logon mein se nafa sunane wale; Shu'bah ne kaha: Logon mein se ghusane wale — jo un ke jhoot ki sach kare, woh mujh se nahin, main us se nahin"
"2343","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Kaseer se, Abu Ansari Ibrahim se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap sahaba ne Hudaibiyah ke din sar muunde, Usman bin siwae Affan aur Abu ke Qatadah to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mundne walon ke liye teen martaba bakhshish mangi, kataravaane walon ke liye ek martaba"
"2344","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Musanna ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu muttavakkila se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se barabar-barabar, chandi chandi se barabar-barabar"
"2345","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Iyaz se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein sadqa-Fitr sa'-sa' nikalte the, jabke us din un ka khana khajoor-kishmish tha"
"2346","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Humaid bin Abd bin Rahman se, Abu Khudri se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masjid ke qible mein thook dekha aur use kankari se khuracaa. aur farmaya: Aadmi apne samne na thooke, na apne daayen; lekin apne baayen ya apne pair ke niice."
"2347","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd ala bin huraqaa ke aazad-karda Rahman se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Khudri se tehband ke bare mein poocha, to kaha: Tum jaanakaara par utre Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min — ya kaha: Musalman — ka tehband aadhi pindliyon tak hai; us ke-takhnon ke darmiyan jo ho; us se neeche jo ho woh aag mein hai Allah use na dekhega jo takabbur se apna tehband ghasiite."
"2348","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salamah bin Kuhail ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Sulami Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Mere bhai ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghare, tumbe, roghan lage bartan se mana kiya; aur kachchi-pakka khajoor ko us se — ya'ni: Nabiiza."
"2349","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mashkize ultaakara peene se mana kiya Zuhri se poocha gaya: Mashkize ultaakara peena Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Un ke munh se piinaa."
"2350","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Maqburi Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rahman bin Abu Sa'id ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Khandaq ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the; ham namazon se mashghool hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal ko hukm diya aur Unhon ne har namaz ke liye iqamat kahi woh is se pahle tha ke Aap par nazil ho: {Agar daro to paidal-sawar}."
"2351","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hamen khabar, unhon ne kaha: Agarr ko kehte suna: Main Abu Khudri aur Abu Hurairah par gawahi deta hun ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi di, farmaya: Allah mohlat deta hai yahan tak ke do tihai raat guzar jae, phir utarta hai aur farmata hai: Koi mangne wala hai? Koi Tauba karne wala hai? Koi gunah se mu'afi mangne wala hai? To ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Fajr nikalne tak? To kaha: Ji Han"
"2352","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Agarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Khudri aur Abu Hurairah par gawahi deta hun ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi di, farmaya: Koi qaum Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr karte nahin baithe magar farishte unhen gher lete hain, rehmat unhen dhank leti hai, un par sakiinaa utarti hai, aur Allah Azza-wa Jall un ka zikr apne paas walon mein karta hai"
"2353","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin Rabi' aur Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Masrooq se, Rahman bin Abu nuema se, Abu Khudri se, ke Ali ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf mitti par Sona bheja to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use us din chaar ke darmiyan taqseem kiya; Uyainah bin Fazari hisna, Alqamah bin kilaabii ulaasaa, Aqra bin hanzalii Habis aur Taayi zaidula-khaila ke darmiyan — phir hazzaana ke beton mein se ek to Quraish-Ansar gussa hue aur kaha: Najd walon ko dete hain, hamen chhodte hain! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne unhen maanuusa karne ke liye diya to ek aadmi khada hua, dhansii aankhon wala, muunde sar wala, ubharii rukhsaron wala, ubhare maathe chhae to us ne kaha: Allah se hon to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki ita'at kaun karega agar main us ki nafarmani karun? Kya mujh par aasman wale munasib karte hain aur tum mujh par munasib nahin karte? To Umar ne un se qatl ki ijazat mangi, aur Aap ne inkar kiya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is ki nasla se qaum niklegi jo Quran parhegii, un ke halaq se na utaregaa; Islam se hain jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai woh Islam walon ko qatl karenge aur but walon ko chorenge. Allah ki qasam, agar Main ne unhen paya to unhen aada ki tarah qatl karunga"
"2354","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Amrah se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah se kaha gaya: Abu kehte Khudri hain: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat sirf mahram rishtedar ke sath safar kare to A'ishah apne sath walon mein se kisi ki taraf muriin aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, sabake paas mahram nahin hai"
"2355","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Waleed bin ayazaara se, unhon ne kaha: Saqeef ke ek aadmi ko suna, Kinanah ke ek aadmi se bayan karte hue, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is aayat ke bare mein farmaya: {Phir Ham ne Kitab ka waris unhen banaya jinhein Ham ne apne bandon mein se muntakhib} aayat farmaya: Sab jannat mein hain — ya kaha: Sab ek darje mein hain Shu'bah ne donon mein se ek kaha"
"2356","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Muhammad bin qarazaa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne qurbani ke liye mendha khareeda, lekin bheriye ne us ki gunah — ya us ki gunah mein se — karega to Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, to farmaya: Use zabah karo"
"2357","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, qazaaa se, Abu Khudri se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Eid-Fitr aur Eid-Azha ke din roze se mana kiya"
"2358","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Salih se, Abu Hashimi Alqamah se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Autas ke din hamen shauhar wali aurten miliin, aur Ham ne un se humbistari napasand ki to Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, aur nazil hui: {Aur shauhar wali aurten siwae tumhari laundiyon ke}."
"2359","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Umamah Hunaif Sahl ko suna, Abu Khudri se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Quraizah ke hukm mein Sa'd bin Mu'az ko bheja to woh gadhe par aaye jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qareeb hue to farmaya: Apne sardar ki taraf khade ho — ya kaha: Apne behtar ki taraf jab woh aae to farmaya: Mein faisla karo unhon ne kaha: Main mein faisla karta hun ke un ke ladne wale qatl kiye jaen, un ki aulaad qaid ki jae to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne Badshah ke hukm se faisla kiya"
"2360","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musanna aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu usvaarii Isa se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beemar ki iyadat karo, janazon ke peeche chalo; tumhen aakhirat ki yaad dilaaenge."
"2361","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Yahya ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke din aur Eid-Fitr ke din roze se mana kiya, aur Asr ke baad aur Fajr ke baad namaz se mana kiya"
"2362","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, Asma bin Ubaid se, Sa'ib se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khudri ko bayan karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: In gharon ke saanp hain; jo tum dekho use teen martaba dhamakaao; us ke baad jo lage woh kafir hai, use qatl karo"
"2363","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Uqbah bin Abd bin ghaafira se, Abu Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Hamen mana kiya gaya ke kishmish-khajoor ko milayen, aur kachchi-pakka khajoor ko nabeez ke liye milaaen."
"2364","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, nakhaii Ibrahim se, Masrooq se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Mas'ud ka zikr Aas ke paas hua, to unhon ne kaha: Woh aadmi hai jis se main hamesha muhabbat basaunga, jabase Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Quran chaar se seekho; Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Abu Huzaifah ke aazad-karda Salim se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, Jabal ke bete Mu'az se"
"2365","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Wa'il ko suna, Masrooq se bayan karte hue, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mujhe sab mahboob tumhare behtareen akhlaq wale hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) na fahasha the na ghaflat the"
"2366","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Wa'il ko sunte hue bayan karte, Masrooq se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Aas ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Quran chaar se seekho; Abdullah, Mu'az, Ubayy aur Abu Huzaifah ke aazad-karda Salim se"
"2367","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Taimi Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Zur'ah Jarir Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abdullah bin Aas ke paas the ke do aadmi aae aur kaha: Ham tumhare paas Marwan ke paas se aae; Ham ne use kehte suna: Nikalne wali pehli nishani Dajjal ka nikalna hai to Abdullah bin Aas ne kaha: Marwan ne jhoot kaha; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees suni jo main nahin bhuulaa. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Nikalne wali pehli nishani suraj ka Maghrib se nikalna hai, ya janwar ka logon par Chasht ko nikalna; donon mein se jo apne sathi se pahle hui, doosri us ke baad qareeb hogi Abdullah bin Aas ne kaha: Mera khayal hai pehli suraj ka Maghrib se nikalna hai"
"2368","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Azdi Ayyub se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zuhr ka waqt hai jab suraj dhal aur aadmi ka saya us ke qad jaisa ho, jab tak Asr na aaye Asr ka waqt hai jab tak suraj zard na ho Maghrib ka waqt hai jab tak shafaq na posheeda — Shu'bah ne kaha: Jab tak shafaq ki roshan na duube. Isha ka waqt tumhare-aadhi raat ke darmiyan hai Fajr ka waqt hai jab tulu' ho, jab tak suraj na nikle Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne kaha: Kabhi marfu' karte the, kabhi marfu' nahin karte the"
"2369","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman bin Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Anbas ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Abdullah bin Aas ne vahta mein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare liye apni ungli modi aur farmaya: Raham Rahman Azza-wa Jall se jurii shaakh hai, jurii hai, zaban zuban wali hai, jo chahe bolatii hai jo use jodega Allah use jodega; jo use todega Allah Azza-wa Jall use jayega"
"2370","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Rahman bin Ziyad se, Abd bin Rahman bin Rafi' se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein dakhil hue jabke qaum Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr kar rahi thi, qaum fiqh ka muzaaqaraa kar rahi thi to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Donon majlis bhalai ki taraf hain; rahe woh jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ka zikr karte hain aur apne Rabb se mangte hain, agar woh chahe unhen de, chahe unhen roke. aur yeh logon ko sikhate-seekhte hain; main to muallima bana bheja gaya hun, aur yeh afzal hai to un ke sath baithe"
"2371","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd bin Rahman bin Ziyad bin anauma ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Rahman bin Rafi' se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aakhri sajde se sar uthae phir hadas kare, to us ki namaz poori hui"
"2372","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd bin Rahman bin Ziyad bin anauma se, Abd bin Rahman bin Rafi' se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) resham-Sona lekar nikle aur farmaya: Yeh donon meri ummat ke mardon par haram hain, un ki aurton ke liye halal hain"
"2373","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Abu Sabit ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Makki Abbas ko suna — woh shayar the, hadees mein un par mansoob na tha — unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Aas ko kehte suna: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jihad ki ijazat mangne aaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhare walidain zinda hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Unhin mein jihad karo"
"2374","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Abu Sabit ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Abbas ko kehte suna: Abdullah bin Aas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya mujhe khabar nahin di gayi ke tum tamam raat qiyam karte ho aur din bhar roza rakhte ho? Jab tum aisa karoge to aankh baithegii, nafs thakegaa. Jis ne hamesha roza rakha Us ne roza nahin rakha har mahine teen din roza saal bhar roza hai main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main taqat rakhta hun farmaya: Dawud ka roza rakho; woh ek din roza rakhte the, ek din iftar karte the; maidan mein milne par na bhaagate the"
"2375","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se: Abu Abbas ko suna, Abdullah bin Aas se bayan karte hue, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen paanch din mein Quran padhne ka hukm diya"
"2376","[AI-translation] Yunus ne, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qarz-be' se mana kiya, be' mein do sharton se mana kiya, jo tumhare paas nahin us ke bechne se mana kiya, aur baghair zamanat nafa se mana kiya"
"2377","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khayyat khalifa ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momineen ke khoon barabar hain; woh doosron par ek hath hain"
"2378","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khayyat Hubairah khalifa ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khae phir us se behtar dekhe, use kare; Wahy us ka kaffara hai"
"2379","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalifa ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ka'ba se peeth lagai aur farmaya: Fajr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke suraj nikle; Asr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke suraj duube."
"2380","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, ek aadmi se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khao-piyo-pahno, Sadqa do; Allah Azza-wa Jall pasand karta hai ke apne bande par apni nemat ka asar dekhe"
"2381","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mulaiki Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Rozedar ke liye iftar ke waqt qabool dua hai Abdullah bin Aas jab iftar karte to ghar-bachchon ko bulaye aur dua karte the"
"2382","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Musanna se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne tumhen ek namaz zyada di; us ki hifazat karo, woh witr hai"
"2383","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Usamah bin Zaid se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke sadqe un ke pani — ya: Un ke aangana par liye jaenge; Abu Dawud ko shak hua"
"2384","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, muallima Habib se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nikah se pahle talaq nahin, milkiyat se pahle aazad nahin"
"2385","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Woh chhoti luutiyata hai — ya'ni aurat ke peeche aanaa."
"2386","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muallima Habib ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab aadmi aurat ka Malik ho to us ka Atiyyah sirf us ki ijazat se jaiz hai"
"2387","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Rashid ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman bin Musa se, Amr bin Shu'aib se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ahle-Kitab Yahudi-Nasrani ki diyat Musalman ki diyat se aadhi hai"
"2388","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Abd bin Rahman ko kehte suna: Abdullah bin Aas ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sab bade gunahon mein se hai ke aadmi Islam mein apne walidain ko bura de kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, woh apne walidain ko kaise bura deta hai? Farmaya: Woh aadmi se bura-galauja karta hai aur woh us ke baap ko bura deta hai, ya woh us ki walidah ko bura deta hai aur woh us ki walidah ko bura deta hai"
"2389","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, hazzaaa Khalid se, Qasim bin Rabi'ah se, Uqbah bin Aws se — Khalid samajhte hain Abdullah bin Aas se — ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab Makkah fath kiya to farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, akela; Us ne apna wa'da sach kiya, apne bande ki madad ki, grohon ko akele shikast di Khabardar, har Purane izzat jo gini-da'wa ki jati hai, khoon-maal, mere in donon qadmon tale hai, siwae Kaabe ki rakhavaalii aur Hajiyon ko pani pilane ke"
"2390","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sauri Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, raihaana bin Yazid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Maal ke liye Sadqa halal nahin, na qawi tandurusta ke liye"
"2391","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se: Abdullah bin Haris ko suna, Abu zubaidii Kaseer se bayan karte hue, Abdullah bin Aas bin Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho; zulm qayamat ke din andhere hain fahasha se bacho; Allah fahasha-behuudagii ko pasand nahin karta bukhl se bacho; Us ne tum pahle walon ko halaak kiya; unhen qata-rehmi ka hukm diya aur Unhon ne tode, unhen bukhl ka hukm diya aur Unhon ne bukhl ki, unhen burai ka hukm diya aur Unhon ne burai ki to ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaun-sa Islam afzal hai? Shu'bah ne kaha: Jis se Musalman us ki zuban-hath se samet rahen Mas'udi ne kaha: Musalman tumhari zuban-hath se samet rahen to woh aadmi ya doosra khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaun-si hijrat afzal hai? Farmaya: Tum woh chhodo jo tumhare Rabb ko napasand hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hijrat do hain; Shehri ki hijrat, dehati ki hijarata. raha dehati, woh bulaye par aata hai, hukm par karta hai; raha Shehri, us ki aazmaish bade hai, us ka ajr afzal hai Mas'udi ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Aap pukara: Ya Rasulullah, kaun-se shaheed afzal hain? Farmaya: Tumhara ghoda kata jae aur tumhara khoon bahaane"
"2392","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin Sa'ib se, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se kaha: tum Quran kitne din mein padhte ho? Main ne kaha: Din-do raat mein unhon ne kaha: Mujh se kam ki, Main ne un se kam ki, yahan tak ke farmaya: Use saat din mein padho"
"2393","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Mujahid se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jo ghair-baap ki taraf marfooan hua, woh jannat ki khushbu na suunghegaa, jabke us ki khushbu sattar saal ki doori se pa jati hai jab yeh junaadaa bin Abu Umayyah ne dekha — Mu'awiyah use god le chahte the — to junaadaa ne kaha: Main tumhare tarqash ka teer hun; mujhe jahan chaho daalein"
"2394","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin shikhkhiira se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo teen se kam mein padhe, Us ne samjha nahin — ya'ni quraaana."
"2395","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere Abd Haris bin maamuun Rahman ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Salamah Rahman Abd se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rishwat dene wale aur rishwat lene wale par lanat ki"
"2396","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Muslim bin Abu vazzaaha ne ham se bayan kiya, ala bin Abdullah bin Rafi' se, hanaana bin Kharijah se, Abdullah bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Uunce shehar ka zarii-ruukhaa dehati aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamen hijrat ki khabar den; Kya woh tumhari taraf hai jidhar tum ho? Ya ma'loom zameen ki taraf, ya khaas qaum ke liye, ya jab tum mar jao to khatm? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un se khamosh rahe, phir farmaya: Poochne wala kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main hazir hun, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Hijrat hai ke zahir-chipii buraiyan chhodo; phir tum Muhajir ho chahe Shahr mein maro. Abdullah bin Aas ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamen jannat ke kapdon ki khabar den; banae jate hain ya bane jate hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khamosh rahe aur kuch log hone to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kyun hanste ho? Kya jahil se jo aalim se poocha?! Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Poochne wala kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main hazir hun, Aey Allah ke farmaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin un se jannat ke phal phatenge, lekin un se jannat ke phal phatenge — do martaba to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hijrat-jihad ke bare mein tumhara Kya kehna hai? To farmaya: Aey Abdullah, apne nafs se shuru karo aur us se jang karo, apne nafs se shuru karo aur us se jihad karo agar tum bhaagakara maare gae to Allah tumhen bhagta uthaaegaa; agar dikhaave mein maare gae to Allah tumhen shauhrat karta uthaaegaa; agar sabr-sawab mein maare gae to Allah tumhen sabr-muhatasiba uthayega"
"2397","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, Khalid bin maadaana se, ke Jubair bin Nufair ne unhen bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Aas ne unhen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh par do kesariyaa kapde dekhe aur farmaya: Abdullah bin Aey Aas bin Amr, yeh kafiron ke kapde hain; Inhen na pahano."
"2398","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya — bin Uyainah ki hadees zyada kamil hai — Amr bin dinar se, bin Amir ke aazad-karda Suhaib se, Abdullah bin Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jis ne chidiya haq lagai, Allah Azza-wa Jall qayamat ke din us se us ke bare mein sawal karega to kaha gaya: Us ka haq Kya hai? Farmaya: Use zabah kare aur khae, us ka sar kaat na phenke."
"2399","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Talha bin Hilal — ya Hilal bin Talha — ko suna: Abdullah bin Aas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahine ke teen din roza saal bhar roza hai; jo neki laya use das gunaa hai to main ne kaha: Main taqat rakhta hun farmaya: Dawud ka roza rakho; woh ek din roza rakhte the, ek din iftar karte the"
"2400","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Wahb bin Jabir ko kehte suna: Main ne Abdullah bin Aas ko baitul-Maqdis mein dekha, aur un ka ek aazad-karda un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main is mahine yahan theharna chahta hun — ya'ni ramazaana. Abdullah bin Aas ne un se kaha: Kya Tum ne gharwalon ke liye rizq chhodi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Agar nahin to jao aur unhen rizq do; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aadmi ke liye gunah kafi hai ke jise woh paale use zaya kare"
